  <data key="d0">{"name":"Term Life Insurance with Riders","text":"═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n              TERM LIFE INSURANCE POLICY WITH RIDERS\n              ProtectPlus Family Insurance Co.\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nPolicy Number: PP-TL-2024-6729R\nPolicy Date: July 12, 2024\nPolicy Type: 30-Year Level Premium Term\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nINSURED INFORMATION\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nName: Christopher David Bennett\nSex: Male\nDate of Birth: May 20, 1987\nIssue Age: 37\nUnderwriting Class: Preferred Non-Smoker\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nBASE POLICY\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nFace Amount: $750,000\nPolicy Period: 30 years (expires July 12, 2054)\nBase Annual Premium: $612.00\nTotal Annual Premium (including riders): $1,089.00\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nBENEFICIARIES\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nPrimary: Rachel Marie Bennett (Wife) - 60%\n         Christopher Bennett Jr. (Son) - 20%\n         Olivia Grace Bennett (Daughter) - 20%\n\n","summary":"Christopher David Bennett holds a 30-year level premium term life insurance policy with ProtectPlus Family Insurance Co., valued at $750,000, set to expire in 2054. His preferred non-smoker underwriting class supports favorable rates, resulting in a base annual premium of $612 and total annual cost of $1,089 including riders. Primary beneficiaries are his wife Rachel (60%), son Christopher Jr. (20%), and daughter Olivia (20%). The policy provides financial protection for his dependents over three decades.","topics":["Life Insurance","Term Policy","Beneficiary Distribution","Premiums"],"facts":[{"name":"Policy Identification Code","sentence":"The policy number is PP-TL-2024-6729R.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["policy number","insurance documentation","identifier"],"entities":[{"name":"ProtectPlus Family Insurance Co.","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"issuing insurer","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"PP-TL-2024-6729R","type":"POLICY","role":"unique identifier for insured contract","relational_anchors":["Term Life Insurance Policy with Riders"]},{"name":"July 12, 2024","type":"DATE","role":"effective date of policy issuance","relational_anchors":["Policy Date"]},{"name":"July 12, 2054","type":"DATE","role":"expiration date of policy period","relational_anchors":["Policy Period: 30 years"]},{"name":"Christopher David Bennett","type":"PERSON","role":"primary insured individual","relational_anchors":["Issue Age: 37","Underwriting Class: Preferred Non-Smoker"]},{"name":"Rachel Marie Bennett","type":"PERSON","role":"primary beneficiary (spouse)","relational_anchors":["60%"]},{"name":"Christopher Bennett Jr.","type":"PERSON","role":"primary beneficiary (son)","relational_anchors":["20%"]},{"name":"Olivia Grace Bennett","type":"PERSON","role":"primary beneficiary (daughter)","relational_anchors":["20%"]},{"name":"$750,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"face amount of base coverage","relational_anchors":["Face Amount"]},{"name":"$612.00","type":"AMOUNT","role":"base annual premium cost","relational_anchors":["Base Annual Premium"]},{"name":"$1,089.00","type":"AMOUNT","role":"total annual premium including riders","relational_anchors":["Total Annual Premium (including riders)"]}]},{"name":"Policy Effective Date","sentence":"The policy date is July 12, 2024.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["policy date","coverage start","term life insurance"],"entities":[{"name":"ProtectPlus Family Insurance Co.","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"issuing insurer","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"PP-TL-2024-6729R","type":"POLICY","role":"unique identifier for insured contract","relational_anchors":["Term Life Insurance Policy with Riders"]},{"name":"July 12, 2024","ty