<node id="fce22f63-5d59-4227-ac5b-655f0633c455">
  <data key="d0">{"name":"Insurance Policy &amp; Beneficiary Terms","text":"═════════════════\nPrimary: Rachel Marie Bennett (Wife) - 60%\n         Christopher Bennett Jr. (Son) - 20%\n         Olivia Grace Bennett (Daughter) - 20%\n\nContingent: Bennett Family Irrevocable Trust - 100%\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nPOLICY DEFINITIONS\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\"Disability\" means the complete inability to perform the material \nand substantial duties of your regular occupation due to sickness \nor injury.\n\n\"Terminal Illness\" means a condition expected to result in death \nwithin 24 months as certified by a physician.\n\n\"Chronic Illness\" means the inability to perform at least 2 of 6 \nActivities of Daily Living for at least 90 days.\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nSECTION 1: BASE POLICY COVERAGE\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n1.1 We will pay the death benefit if the insured dies while this \n    policy is in force and all premiums have been paid.\n\n1.2 Payment will be made to the beneficiary within 30 days of \n    receiving satisfactory proof of death.\n\n1.3 EXCLUSION - SUICIDE: If death occurs by suicide within 2 years \n    of the issue date, we will pay only the premiums paid, without \n    interest.\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nSECTION 2: ATTACHED RIDERS\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nRIDER 1: WAIVER OF PREMIUM DUE TO DISABILITY\nPremium: $102/year\n\n","summary":"This life insurance policy provides a death benefit payable to designated beneficiaries—Rachel Marie Bennett (60%), Christopher Bennett Jr. (20%), and Olivia Grace Bennett (20%)—with a contingent beneficiary being the Bennett Family Irrevocable Trust. Coverage includes provisions for death during the policy term, exclusion of suicide claims within two years, and a 30-day payment timeline upon proof of death. Key definitions include Disability, Terminal Illness, and Chronic Illness. A rider waives annual premiums ($102) if the insured becomes disabled and unable to work.","topics":["Life Insurance","Beneficiary Distribution","Disability Coverage","Policy Riders"],"facts":[{"name":"Primary Beneficiary Designation","sentence":"Rachel Marie Bennett is designated as a primary beneficiary.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["primary beneficiaries","death benefit distribution","Rachel Marie Bennett"],"entities":[{"name":"Rachel Marie Bennett","type":"PERSON","role":"primary beneficiary spouse","relational_anchors":["Wife","60%"]},{"name":"Christopher Bennett Jr.","type":"PERSON","role":"primary beneficiary son","relational_anchors":["Son","20%"]},{"name":"Olivia Grace Bennett","type":"PERSON","role":"primary beneficiary daughter","relational_anchors":["Daughter","20%"]},{"name":"Bennett Family Irrevocable Trust","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"contingent beneficiary","relational_anchors":["100%","Irrevocable"]},{"name":"Disability","type":"CONCEPT","role":"definition of covered event","relational_anchors":["complete inability","regular occupation","sickness or injury"]},{"name":"Terminal Illness","type":"CONCEPT","role":"definition of covered event","relational_anchors":["expected to result in death","24 months","physician certification"]},{"name":"Chronic Illness","type":"CONCEPT","role":"definition of covered event","relational_anchors":["inability to perform 2 of 6 ADLs","90 days"]},{"name":"Section 1: Base Policy Coverage","type":"SECTION","role":"core benefits section","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Death Benefit","type":"COVERAGE","role":"payment upon insured's death","relational_anchors":["paid when policy in force","all premiums paid"]},{"name":"30 days","type":"TIMEFRAME","role":"deadline for claim payout","relational_anchors":["within 30 days","proof of death received"]},{"name":"Suicide Exclusion","type":"EXCLUSION","role":"limitation on death benefit","relational_anchors":["suicide within 2 years","issue date","premiums paid only"]},{"name":"Waiver of Premium Due to Disability","type":"RIDER","role":"additional rider for premium relief","relational_anchors":["$102/year","Rider 1"]}]},{"name":"Primary Beneficiary Designation","sentence":"Christopher Bennett Jr. is designated as a primary beneficiary.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["primary beneficiaries","death benefit allocation","family inheritance"],"entities":[{"name":"Rachel Marie Bennett","type":"PERSON","role":"primary beneficiary spouse","relational_anchors":["Wife","60%"]},{"name":"Christopher Bennett Jr.","type":"PERSON","role":"primary beneficiary son","relational_anchors":["Son","20%"]},{"name":"Olivia Grace Bennett","type":"PERSON","role":"primary beneficiary daughter","relational_anchors":["Daughter","20%"]},{"name":"Bennett Family Irrevocable Trust","type":"ORGANIZATION","role":"contingent beneficiary","relational_anchors":["100%","Irrevocable"]},{"name":"Disability","type":"CONCEPT","role":"definition of covered event","relational_anchors":["complete inability","regular occupation","sickness or injury"]},{"name":"Terminal Illness","type":"CONCEPT","role":"definition of covered event","relational_anchors":["expected to result in death","24 months","physician certification"]},{"name":"Chronic Illness","type":"CONCEPT","role":"definition of covered event","relational_anchors":["inability to perform 2 of 6 ADLs","90 days"]},{"name":"Section 1: Base Policy Coverage","type":"SECTION","role":"core benefits section","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Death Benefit","type":"COVERAGE","role":"payment upon insured's death","relational_anchors":["paid when policy in force","all premiums paid"]},{"name":"30 days","type":"TIMEFRAME","role":"deadline for claim payout","relational_anchors":["within 30 days","proof of death received"]},{"name":"Suicide Exclusion","type":"EXCLUSION","role":"limitation on death ben