  <data key="d0">{"name":"Waiver of Premium Due to Disability","type":"RIDER","role":"additional rider for premium relief","relational_anchors":["$102/year","Rider 1"]}</data>
  <data key="d1">entity</data>
</node>
<node id="3a50b7ae-fa72-4c8d-89d2-bec45990f9e7">
  <data key="d0">{"name":"Insurance Rider Benefits Overview","text":"═══════════════════════════════════════════════\n\nRIDER 1: WAIVER OF PREMIUM DUE TO DISABILITY\nPremium: $102/year\n\nIf you become totally disabled before age 60 and remain disabled \nfor 6 consecutive months:\n• All future premiums are waived\n• Coverage continues in full force\n• Waiver continues until you recover, return to work, or age 65\n• Must submit annual proof of continuing disability\n\nRIDER 2: ACCELERATED DEATH BENEFIT - TERMINAL ILLNESS\nPremium: Included at no charge\n\nIf diagnosed with a terminal illness:\n• May access up to 95% of death benefit while living\n• Minimum advance: $10,000\n• Maximum advance: $500,000\n• Benefit reduced by actuarial discount (approximately 8% per year)\n• Remaining death benefit paid to beneficiaries upon death\n\nRIDER 3: ACCELERATED DEATH BENEFIT - CHRONIC ILLNESS\nPremium: $48/year\n\nIf you become chronically ill and cannot perform 2+ Activities of \nDaily Living (bathing, dressing, eating, toileting, transferring, \ncontinence):\n• May access up to 2% of face amount per month\n• Maximum total advance: 50% of face amount\n• No actuarial discount applied\n• Must be certified by licensed healthcare practitioner\n\nRIDER 4: CHILDREN'S TERM INSURANCE RIDER\nPremium: $156/year\n\nProvides $15,000 coverage on each eligible child:\n• Covers all natural and legally adopted children\n• Coverage from birth (or adoption) to age 25\n• Automatically includes future children\n• No medical exam required\n• Children may convert to individual policy at age 25 without \n  evidence of insurability, up to 5 times the rider amount\n\nCovered Children:\n- Christopher Bennett Jr. (Age 8)\n- Olivia Grace Bennett (Age 5)\n\nRIDER 5: ACCIDENTAL DEATH BENEFIT\nPremium: $94/year\n\nPays an additional $750,000 if death results from accidental injury:\n• Accident must be the direct cause of death\n• Death must occur within 90","summary":"This document details five supplemental insurance riders: a premium waiver for long-term disability, two types of accelerated death benefits (terminal and chronic illness), coverage for children up to age 25, and an accidental death benefit. Each rider has specific qualifying conditions, payment structures, and associated premiums. The riders provide enhanced financial security during critical health events, family needs, or unexpected accidents.","topics":["Disability Protection","Death Benefit Riders","Family Coverage","Accidental Death Benefits"],"facts":[{"name":"Waiver Premium Amount","sentence":"The premium for Rider 1: Waiver of Premium Due to Disability is $102 per year.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Waiver of Premium","Disability Insurance","Annual Premium"],"entities":[{"name":"WAIVER OF PREMIUM DUE TO DISABILITY","type":"RIDERS","role":"provides premium relief after long-term disability","relational_anchors":["premium: $102/year","age 60","6 consecutive months","until recovery, return to work, or age 65","annual proof of disability"]},{"name":"ACCELERATED DEATH BENEFIT - TERMINAL ILLNESS","type":"RIDERS","role":"allows early withdrawal of death benefit due to terminal diagnosis","relational_anchors":["included at no charge","up to 95% of death benefit","minimum advance: $10,000","maximum advance: $500,000","actuarial discount approximately 8% per year"]},{"name":"ACCELERATED DEATH BENEFIT - CHRONIC ILLNESS","type":"RIDERS","role":"permits monthly advances for chronic care needs","relational_anchors":["premium: $48/year","up to 2% of face amount per month","maximum total advance: 50% of face amount","no actuarial discount","certified by licensed healthcare practitioner"]},{"name":"CHILDREN'S TERM INSURANCE RIDER","type":"RIDERS","role":"covers dependent children under term life plan","relational_anchors":["premium: $156/year","$15,000 coverage per child","from birth or adoption to age 25","automatically includes future children","conversion option at age 25 without evidence of insurability","up to 5 times the rider amount"]},{"name":"Christopher Bennett Jr.","type":"PERSON","role":"eligible insured child under rider","relational_anchors":["Age 8","covered child"]},{"name":"Olivia Grace Bennett","type":"PERSON","role":"eligible insured child under rider","relational_anchors":["Age 5","covered child"]},{"name":"ACCIDENTAL DEATH BENEFIT","type":"RIDERS","role":"pays extra death benefit for accident-caused fatalities","relational_anchors":["premium: $94/year","$750,000 additional benefit","accident must be direct cause of death","death occurs within 90 days"]}]},{"name":"Disability Premium Waiver Eligibility","sentence":"Rider 1 applies if the insured becomes totally disabled before age 60.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["disability","premium waiver","age 60"],"entities":[{"name":"WAIVER OF PREMIUM DUE TO DISABILITY","type":"RIDERS","role":"provides premium relief after long-term disability","relational_anchors":["premium: $102/year","age 60","6 consecutive months","until recovery, return to work, or age 65","annual proof of disability"]},{"name":"ACCELERATED DEATH BENEFIT - TERMINAL ILLNESS","type":"RIDERS","role":"allows early withdrawal of death benefit due to terminal diagnosis","relational_anchors":["included at no charge","up to 95% of death benefit","minimum advance: $10,000","maximum advance: $500,000","actuarial discount approximately 8% per year"]},{"name":"ACCELERATED DEATH BENEFIT - CHRONIC ILLNESS","type":"RIDERS","role":"permits monthly advances for chronic care needs","relational_anchors":["premium: $48/year","up to 2% of face amount per month","maximum total advance: 50% of face amount","no actuarial discount","certified by licensed healthcare practitioner"]},{"name":"CHILDREN'S TERM INSURANCE RIDER","type":"RIDERS","role":"covers dependent children under term life plan","relational_anchors":["premium: $156/year","$15,000 coverage per child","from birth or adoption to age 25","automatically includes future children","conversion option at age 25 without evidence of insurability","up to 5 times the rider amount"]},{"name":"Christopher Bennett Jr.","type":"PERSON","role":"eligible insured child under rider","relational_anchors":["Age 8","covered child"]},{"name":"Olivia Grace Bennett","type":"PERSON","role":"eligible insured child under rider","relational_anchors":["Age 5","covered child"]},{"name":"ACCIDENTAL DEATH BENEFIT","type":"RIDERS","role":"pays extra death benefit for accident-caused fatalities","relational_anchors":["premium: $94/year","$750,000 additional benefit","accident must be direct cause of death","death occurs within 90 days"]}]},{"name":"Disability Duration Requirement","sentence":"Rider 1 requires the insured to remain disabled for 6 consecutive months.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["disability duration","premium waiver","consecutive months"],"entities":[{"name":"WAIVER OF PREMIUM DUE TO DISABILITY","type":"RIDERS","role":"provides premium relief after long-term disability","relational_anchors":["premium: $102/year","age 60","6 consecutive months","until recovery, return to work, or age 65","annual proof of disability"]},{"name":"ACCELERATED DEATH BENEFIT - TERMINAL ILLNESS","type":"RIDERS","role":"allows early withdrawal of death benefit due to terminal diagnosis","relational_anchors":["included at no charge","up to 95% of death benefit","minimum advance: $10,000","maximum advance: $500,000","actuarial discount approximately 8% per year"]},{"name":"ACCELERATED DEATH BENEFIT - CHRONIC ILLNESS","type":"RIDERS","role":"permits monthly advances for chronic care needs","relational_anchors":["premium: $48/year","up to 2% of face amount per month","maximum total advance: 50% of face amount","no actuarial discount","certified by licensed healthcare practitioner"]},{"name":"CHILDREN'S TERM INSURANCE RIDER","type":"RIDERS","role":"covers dependent children under term life plan","relational_anchors":["premium: $156/year","$15,000 coverage per child","from birth or adoption to age 25","automatically includes future children","conversion option at age 25 without evidence of insurability","up to 5 times the rider amount"]},{"name":"Christopher Bennett Jr.","type":"PERSON","role":"eligible insured child under rider","relational_anchors":["Age 8","covered child"]},{"name":"Olivia Grace Bennett","type":"PERSON","role":"eligible insured child under rider","relational_anchors":["Age 5","covered child"]},{"name":"ACCIDENTAL DEATH BENEFIT","type":"RIDERS","role":"pays extra death benefit for accident-caused fatalities","relational_anchors":["premium: $94/year","$750,000 additional benefit","accident must be direct cause of death","death occurs within 90 days"]}]},{"name":"Premium Waiver Due to Disability","sentence":"Under Rider 1, all future premiums are waived if the condition is met.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["premium waiver","disability coverage","future premiums"],"entities":[{"name":"WAIVER OF PREMIUM DUE TO DISABILITY","type":"RIDERS","role":"provides premium relief after long-term disability","relational_anchors":["premium: $102/year","age 60","6 consecutive months","until recovery, return to work, or age 65","annual proof of disability"]},{"name":"ACCELERATED DEATH BENEFIT - TERMINAL ILLNESS","type":"RIDERS","role":"allows early withdrawal of death benefit due to terminal diagnosis","relational_anchors":["included at no charge","up to 95% of death benefit","minimum advance: $10,000","maximum advance: $500,000","actuarial discount approximately 8% per year"]},{"name":"ACCELERATED DEATH BENEFIT - CHRONIC ILLNESS","type":"RIDERS","role":"permits monthly advances for chronic care needs","relational_anchors":["premium: $48/year","up to 2% of face amount per month","maximum total advance: 50% of face amount","no actuarial discount","certified by licensed healthcare practitioner"]},{"name":"CHILDREN'S TERM INSURANCE RIDER","type":"RIDERS","role":"covers dependent children under term life plan","relational_anchors":["premium: $156/year","$15,000 coverage per child","from birth or adoption to age 25","automatically includes future children","conversion option at age 25 without evidence of insurability","up to 5 times the rider amount"]},{"name":"Christopher Bennett Jr.","type":"PERSON","role":"eligible insured child under rider","relational_anchors":["Age 8","covered child"]},{"name":"Olivia Grace Bennett","type":"PERSON","role":"eligible insured child under rider","relational_anchors":["Age 5","covered child"]},{"name":"ACCIDENTAL DEATH BENEFIT","type":"RIDERS","role":"pays extra death benefit for accident-caused fatalities","relational_anchors":["premium: $94/year","$750,000 additional benefit","accident must be direct cause of death","death occurs within 90 days"]}]},{"name":"Waiver Maintains Full Coverage","sentence":"Coverage under Rider 1 continues in full force if the waiver is activated.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["premium waiver","disability coverage","continued benefits"],"entities":[{"name":"WAIVER OF PREMIUM DUE TO DISABILITY","type":"RIDERS","role":"provides premium relief after long-term disability","relational_anchors":["premium: $102/year","age 60","6 consecutive months","until recovery, return to work, or age 65","annual proof of disability"]},{"name":"ACCELERATED DEATH BENEFIT - TERMINAL ILLNESS","type":"RIDERS","role":"allows early withdrawal of death benefit due to terminal diagnosis","relational_anchors":["included at no charge","up to 95% of death benefit","minimum advance: $10,000","maximum advance: $500,000","actuarial discount approximately 8% per year"]},{"name":"ACCELERATED DEATH BENEFIT - CHRONIC ILLNESS","type":"RIDERS","role":"permits monthly advances for chronic care needs","relational_anchors":["premium: $48/year","up to 2% of face amount per month","maximum total advance: 50% of face amount","no actuarial discount","certified by licensed healthcare practitioner"]},{"name":"CHILDREN'S TERM INSURANCE RIDER","type":"RIDERS","role":"covers dependent children under te