<node id="aa4c86ba-df00-4375-aaf9-be6ed0e949f3">
  <data key="d0">{"name":"Accidental Death Benefit &amp; Insurability Options","text":" DEATH BENEFIT\nPremium: $94/year\n\nPays an additional $750,000 if death results from accidental injury:\n• Accident must be the direct cause of death\n• Death must occur within 90 days of accident\n• Excludes: suicide, self-inflicted injury, war, aviation (as pilot/crew)\n• No payment if insured was under influence of drugs/alcohol\n• Terminates at insured's age 70\n\nRIDER 6: GUARANTEED INSURABILITY OPTION\nPremium: $89/year\n\nAllows purchase of additional coverage without medical underwriting:\n• May purchase up to $100,000 additional coverage per option date\n• Option dates: Ages 40, 43, 46, 49 and at birth/adoption of child\n• Must exercise within 90 days of option date\n• Premium based on age and class at time of exercise\n• All options terminate at age 50\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nSECTION 3: PREMIUM PAYMENT\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n3.1 Annual Premium: $1,089.00 (base + all riders)\n    Due Date: July 12 of each year\n    Payment Mode: Annual (monthly/quarterly available upon request)\n\n3.2 GRACE PERIOD: 31 days from due date. Coverage continues during \n    grace period. If death occurs during grace period, unpaid \n    premium will be deducted from death benefit.\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nSECTION 4: POLICY RENEWAL AND CONVERSION\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n4.1 This policy is guaranteed renewable to age 95 at increased \n    premiums shown in the renewal rate schedule.\n\n4.2 You may convert all or part of this policy","summary":"This life insurance policy includes a $750,000 accidental death benefit payable only if death results directly from an accident within 90 days, excluding suicide, war, aviation roles, and intoxication. A Guaranteed Insurability Rider allows purchases of up to $100,000 more coverage at specified ages or events like childbirth, exercisable within 90 days. The total annual premium is $1,089, paid annually by July 12, with a 31-day grace period during which coverage remains active. The policy is guaranteed renewable until age 95 and can be converted partially or fully.","topics":["Life Insurance Riders","Death Benefit Terms","Policy Renewal &amp; Conversion","Premium Payments"],"facts":[{"name":"Death Benefit Rider Cost","sentence":"The annual premium for the base policy is $94.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Death Benefit","Rider Premium","Annual Cost"],"entities":[{"name":"$750,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"death benefit payout amount","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"accidental injury","type":"CONCEPT","role":"direct cause of death requirement","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"within 90 days of accident","type":"DATE","role":"time window for claim eligibility","relational_anchors":["90"]},{"name":"suicide","type":"EXCLUSION","role":"excluded cause of death","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"self-inflicted injury","type":"EXCLUSION","role":"excluded cause of death","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"war","type":"EXCLUSION","role":"excluded cause of death","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"aviation (as pilot/crew)","type":"EXCLUSION","role":"excluded activity leading to death","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"under influence of drugs/alcohol","type":"CONDITION","role":"disqualifying condition for payout","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"age 70","type":"AGE_LIMIT","role":"termination point for death benefit","relational_anchors":["70"]},{"name":"RIDER 6: GUARANTEED INSURABILITY OPTION","type":"RIDERS","role":"additional coverage access right","relational_anchors":["$89/year","up to $100,000","ages 40, 43, 46, 49","at birth/adoption of child","90 days","age 50"]},{"name":"$1,089.00","type":"AMOUNT","role":"annual base premium total","relational_anchors":["base + all riders"]},{"name":"July 12","type":"DATE","role":"due date for annual premium","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Annual","type":"PAYMENT_MODE","role":"preferred payment frequency","relational_anchors":["monthly/quarterly available upon request"]},{"name":"31 days from due date","type":"GRACE_PERIOD","role":"coverage continuation window","relational_anchors":["31"]},{"name":"unpaid premium will be deducted from death benefit","type":"DEDUCTION","role":"adjustment applied during grace period death","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"guaranteed renewable to age 95","type":"RENEWAL_TERM","role":"maximum renewability duration","relational_anchors":["95"]}]},{"name":"Accidental Death Payout","sentence":"The Death Benefit pays an additional $750,000 if death results from accidental injury.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["Death Benefit","Accidental Injury","Additional Payout"],"entities":[{"name":"$750,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"death benefit payout amount","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"accidental injury","type":"CONCEPT","role":"direct cause of death requirement","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"within 90 days of accident","type":"DATE","role":"time window for claim eligibility","relational_anchors":["90"]},{"name":"suicide","type":"EXCLUSION","role":"excluded cause of death","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"self-inflicted injury","type":"EXCLUSION","role":"excluded cause of death","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"war","type":"EXCLUSION","role":"excluded cause of death","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"aviation (as pilot/crew)","type":"EXCLUSION","role":"excluded activity leading to death","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"under influence of drugs/alcohol","type":"CONDITION","role":"disqualifying condition for payout","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"age 70","type":"AGE_LIMIT","role":"termination point for death benefit","relational_anchors":["70"]},{"name":"RIDER 6: GUARANTEED INSURABILITY OPTION","type":"RIDERS","role":"additional coverage access right","relational_anchors":["$89/year","up to $100,000","ages 40, 43, 46