<node id="43b0823e-cecd-4a91-a2c4-3d2108893b2c">
  <data key="d0">{"name":"Life Insurance Policy Terms","text":"═══════════════════════\n4.1 This policy is guaranteed renewable to age 95 at increased \n    premiums shown in the renewal rate schedule.\n\n4.2 You may convert all or part of this policy to permanent life \n    insurance without evidence of insurability:\n    • Before the policy expiration date, or\n    • Before your 70th birthday, whichever is earlier\n    • Minimum conversion amount: $50,000\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nSECTION 5: INCONTESTABILITY\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nWe will not contest this policy after it has been in force for \n2 years during the insured's lifetime, except for non-payment of \npremiums.\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nSECTION 6: AVIATION EXCLUSION WAIVER\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nThe standard aviation exclusion has been waived for this policy \nbased on the insured's declared private pilot activities. \nAdditional premium of $175/year is included in the base premium.\n\nCoverage includes death while:\n• Operating or riding as a passenger in any aircraft\n• Exception: military combat operations\n\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\nSECTION 7: POLICY MODIFICATION\n═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n7.1 Riders may be added or removed on any policy anniversary with \n    30 days written notice.\n\n7.2 Adding riders may require evidence of insurability.\n\n7.3 Beneficiary changes may be made at any time by written request.\n\n════════════════════════════════","summary":"This life insurance policy is guaranteed renewable until age 95, with increasing premiums. Policyholders can convert all or part of the coverage to permanent life insurance before age 70 or policy expiry, subject to a minimum of $50,000. After two years of continuous coverage, the insurer cannot contest claims except for unpaid premiums. The aviation exclusion is waived due to the insured’s private piloting activity, adding $175 annually, though military combat flights remain excluded. Riders can be modified annually with prior notice, and beneficiary changes are permitted anytime via written request.","topics":["Policy Renewal","Conversion Options","Aviation Coverage","Policy Modifications"],"facts":[{"name":"Guaranteed Renewal to Age 95","sentence":"This policy is guaranteed renewable to age 95.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["guaranteed renewal","age 95","renewal terms"],"entities":[{"name":"this policy","type":"POLICY","role":"insured coverage subject to terms","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"age 95","type":"DATE","role":"maximum age for guarantee","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"2 years","type":"DATE","role":"contestability period duration","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"70th birthday","type":"AGE","role":"conversion deadline threshold","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"$50,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"minimum conversion requirement","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"aviation exclusion","type":"EXCLUSION","role":"waived risk condition","relational_anchors":["private pilot activities"]},{"name":"$175/year","type":"PREMIUM","role":"additional cost for waiver","relational_anchors":["base premium"]},{"name":"military combat operations","type":"EVENT","role":"excluded scenario under aviation waiver","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Section 5: Incontestability","type":"SECTION","role":"legal protection clause","relational_anchors":["2 years","non-payment of premiums"]},{"name":"Section 6: Aviation Exclusion Waiver","type":"SECTION","role":"coverage extension provision","relational_anchors":["$175/year","private pilot activities"]},{"name":"Section 7: Policy Modification","type":"SECTION","role":"flexibility rule framework","relational_anchors":["any policy anniversary","30 days written notice"]}]},{"name":"Renewal Premium Increases","sentence":"Premiums increase upon renewal according to the renewal rate schedule.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["renewal rate schedule","premium increases","guaranteed renewability"],"entities":[{"name":"this policy","type":"POLICY","role":"insured coverage subject to terms","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"age 95","type":"DATE","role":"maximum age for guarantee","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"2 years","type":"DATE","role":"contestability period duration","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"70th birthday","type":"AGE","role":"conversion deadline threshold","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"$50,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"minimum conversion requirement","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"aviation exclusion","type":"EXCLUSION","role":"waived risk condition","relational_anchors":["private pilot activities"]},{"name":"$175/year","type":"PREMIUM","role":"additional cost for waiver","relational_anchors":["base premium"]},{"name":"military combat operations","type":"EVENT","role":"excluded scenario under aviation waiver","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Section 5: Incontestability","type":"SECTION","role":"legal protection clause","relational_anchors":["2 years","non-payment of premiums"]},{"name":"Section 6: Aviation Exclusion Waiver","type":"SECTION","role":"coverage extension provision","relational_anchors":["$175/year","private pilot activities"]},{"name":"Section 7: Policy Modification","type":"SECTION","role":"flexibility rule framework","relational_anchors":["any policy anniversary","30 days written notice"]}]},{"name":"No Evidence of Insurability Conversion","sentence":"Conversion from this policy to permanent life insurance is allowed without evidence of insurability.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["conversion to permanent insurance","evidence of insurability waiver","policy conversion terms"],"entities":[{"name":"this policy","type":"POLICY","role":"insured coverage subject to terms","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"age 95","type":"DATE","role":"maximum age for guarantee","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"2 years","type":"DATE","role":"contestability period duration","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"70th birthday","type":"AGE","role":"conversion deadline threshold","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"$50,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"minimum conversion requirement","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"aviation exclusion","type":"EXCLUSION","role":"waived risk condition","relational_anchors":["private pilot activities"]},{"name":"$175/year","type":"PREMIUM","role":"additional cost for waiver","relational_anchors":["base premium"]},{"name":"military combat operations","type":"EVENT","role":"excluded scenario under aviation waiver","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"Section 5: Incontestability","type":"SECTION","role":"legal protection clause","relational_anchors":["2 years","non-payment of premiums"]},{"name":"Section 6: Aviation Exclusion Waiver","type":"SECTION","role":"coverage extension provision","relational_anchors":["$175/year","private pilot activities"]},{"name":"Section 7: Policy Modification","type":"SECTION","role":"flexibility rule framework","relational_anchors":["any policy anniversary","30 days written notice"]}]},{"name":"Policy Conversion Timing","sentence":"Conversion can occur before the policy expiration date.","macro_topics":[],"chunk_topics":["conversion option","policy expiration","permanent life insurance"],"entities":[{"name":"this policy","type":"POLICY","role":"insured coverage subject to terms","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"age 95","type":"DATE","role":"maximum age for guarantee","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"2 years","type":"DATE","role":"contestability period duration","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"70th birthday","type":"AGE","role":"conversion deadline threshold","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"$50,000","type":"AMOUNT","role":"minimum conversion requirement","relational_anchors":[]},{"name":"aviation exclusion","type":"EXCLUSION","role":"waived risk condition","relatio