<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="71cb56db-ff8d-4f75-8f77-8f178deac958">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 indicates when the policy ends, and fact_sentence_1 provides its official identification number. Both contribute to uniquely characterizing the policy without direct dependence.</data>
  <data key="d4">defined by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="bc533a59-c7d4-4e25-b428-420fe21e2c8f">
  <data key="d3">July 12, 2054, marks the conclusion of the 30-year term initiated on July 12, 2024, signifying the end of the policy’s active period.</data>
  <data key="d4">follows</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">1.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="266588ad-27a4-4d62-9816-1b806200f081">
  <data key="d3">The expiration date of July 12, 2054, confirms the end of the 30-year coverage period established by the policy’s term type.</data>
  <data key="d4">follows from</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="248ef5d5-b878-4bc5-bd2e-de119e9e1fa0">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s expiration date in 2054 implies an initial issue year consistent with the insured being 37 years old at inception, supporting the claim about his issue age.</data>
  <data key="d4">consistent with</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="e3a10fa4-6951-4c47-8edd-b95f56fa3401">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s expiration date of July 12, 2054, marks the end of its active period during which the $750,000 face amount remains payable upon death.</data>
  <data key="d4">coextensive</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="5e75483f-4994-45c7-ac79-767bd2c6e23e">
  <data key="d3">The expiration date of July 12, 2054, confirms that the policy spans exactly 30 years from its inception, aligning with the stated policy period.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="99a84b43-e3a1-4536-b00a-745e4d038998">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s expiration date defines the timeframe during which the death benefit is payable. Since Rachel is designated as a primary beneficiary receiving 60%, she would only receive her portion if Chris passes away before the policy ends in 2054.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="e225c316-9494-4db7-a2fa-eeff59066bd6">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s long-term nature until 2054 allows ample opportunity for beneficiary updates, making the ability to modify beneficiaries relevant across the entire policy lifecycle.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="59a0f1ea-2c5e-4e7f-b51c-fc1ba344210e">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s long-term validity up to 2054 makes the requirement for evidence of insurability upon adding riders particularly significant, as any rider additions later would trigger that condition.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="6dae6ad4-454c-4c3a-8df2-d65c85b49e1e">
  <data key="d3">The expiration date of the policy sets a future endpoint for coverage, while the zero-day notice requirement allows immediate cancellation before that date; together, they define temporal boundaries and operational control over the policy's lifecycle.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="80f0a3df-332f-4526-af6f-c0a508f1d61f">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s expiration date sets the timeframe during which the accidental death benefit remains applicable, ensuring that the rider is enforceable only while the main policy is active.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="4351e296-ad01-4b03-8073-cffdc596ce2d">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s expiration date sets a time limit beyond which no benefits apply, making it relevant that the accidental death must occur before this date to qualify for payout.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="8ea7b659-7380-42ed-b6f1-e4cffbb45c59">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s expiration date sets a timeframe for coverage, while the suicide exclusion defines conditions under which benefits won’t be paid, ensuring clarity about payout limitations regardless of time.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="58b732d1-91fb-4e00-8dd8-6c20dca4bfb3">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s expiration date sets the timeframe during which coverage applies, including the exclusion for aviation-related deaths that limits when the accidental death benefit may be claimed.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="8f0204f1-a4f1-4add-9ba8-59760c0094b2">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s expiration date sets the timeframe during which coverage applies, while the exclusion of self-inflicted injury defines one of several limitations on claim eligibility within that window.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="b938585a-fc9e-4358-bb77-95bbcf1e1f31">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s expiration in 2054 sets the long-term boundary for coverage, while the 90-day window requirement ensures that accidental deaths qualifying for the benefit occurred within a narrow timeframe after the incident. Together, they define when and under what conditions the accidental death benefit may apply.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="aedfd2a5-0d7e-477f-952c-d53e51f6f0f2">
  <data key="d3">The policy's expiration date sets the timeframe during which coverage is active; however, even within this window, the death benefit may be denied if the insured was under the influence of drugs at the time of death.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional limitation</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="d617fcfa-ca1a-42af-b96a-3031b196a810">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s expiration on July 12, 2054, sets a hard deadline after which Rider 6 becomes irrelevant, as no further actions can be taken once the policy terminates.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="2e9feb03-b57e-4d0b-913c-d96f91607819">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s long-term validity until 2054 makes its death benefit applicable, but only if the insured did not die under the influence of alcohol, per clause in fact_sentence_2.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional dependence</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="87951d9a-26b1-4d25-a8f2-239ec1d0ae52">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s expiration date in 2054 sets the timeframe for the entire contract, including the continued validity of rider-specific benefits such as the Guaranteed Insurability Option, whose annual cost is part of the total premium.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="44e0a4ac-db25-49f7-aa54-1d094f1c0708">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s expiration date limits the window during which additional coverage through RIDER 6 can be utilized, making the timeline critical for exercising the rider.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="5f90df18-58e5-4575-9e58-d2c545796976">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s long-term expiry in 2054 enables the exercise of rider benefits such as those available at age 40, making the timing of the rider options consistent with the overall policy lifespan.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="48571610-7269-4220-a825-c8f2945f622d">
  <data key="d3">The policy's expiration in 2054 aligns with its long-term design, and the mention of age 43 as an option date for RIDER 6 fits within the policy’s duration, suggesting strategic timing for future coverage upgrades.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="9c4cc2e2-e0dd-43cc-9162-2c30fb8592d7">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s expiration date sets a hard deadline beyond which any future rider actions—including those triggered by a child’s birth—can no longer occur. This limits the window for exercising option dates related to family expansion.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="247febe6-9b75-43a5-b350-13e76dd99201">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s long-term expiration in 2054 enables the viability of exercising RIDER 6 benefits at age 46, ensuring future insurability options remain relevant throughout the policy lifecycle.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="b8cb3948-8eb7-4978-b2b6-d2d8621a4b18">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s long-term validity until 2054 enables the exercise of RIDER 6 options, such as at age 49, ensuring continued access to additional coverage when needed.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="9f917507-b0ee-48c4-98b8-f7fc168084ef">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s long-term validity through 2054 coexists with the early termination of Rider 6 benefits at age 50, meaning some supplemental protections cease before the main policy ends.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="177ee328-91d5-42c3-be6e-22a540d6f1cb">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s long-term nature, expiring in 2054, sets the temporal framework within which optional coverage upgrades may occur. The requirement to act within 90 days of an option date aligns with potential mid-policy enhancements prior to expiration.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="fd499eef-7e7e-4325-9622-d0c882722492">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s expiration date sets a hard deadline beyond which no further actions, such as exercising the Guaranteed Insurability Rider, may occur. This constrains the applicability of the rider’s terms described in fact_sentence_2.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="92f0d544-ff95-4002-8c1e-cce1e2ed72b1">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 establishes the policy’s end date in 2054, providing temporal context that frames when the recurring $1,089 annual premium applies. This helps confirm the long-term commitment implied by the policy's terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="ff41a674-10ac-4c9e-a832-459e288b75df">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s expiration on July 12, 2054, aligns with the annual premium due date, implying the final payment could occur on the same day the policy ends, marking its conclusion.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="219bffde-d1a5-460e-82a7-164eb4b6a157">
  <data key="d3">The policy's expiration date in 2054 depends on consistent annual payments to maintain coverage throughout its term.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="e6de81af-aa16-485d-9cca-a6d0499ae0d5">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s expiration date sets the endpoint of its lifecycle, but coverage persists through a 31-day grace period, ensuring uninterrupted protection even if the annual premium isn’t paid exactly on time.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="5056bd4e-5477-4eaf-bb15-46b84bab7d04">
  <data key="d3">The policy's expiration date depends on timely payments; however, the 31-day grace period prevents immediate lapse upon missed deadlines, allowing temporary continuation past July 12, 2054.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="d35ea843-3cf7-4434-abd8-5317e92704d1">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s fixed expiration in 2054 coexists with a clause allowing renewal until age 95, suggesting potential extension beyond the stated end date depending on the insured’s lifespan and insurer terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="9c3e6312-c3f4-4a65-ae25-1fdcea64f33e">
  <data key="d3">The policy's expiration date sets the temporal boundary for its validity, making the grace period clause relevant specifically around that time; if death occurs just after the due date but before the end of the 31-day grace period, the unpaid premium reduces the death benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c" target="f02ad15a-f220-4368-928b-f055e35cac36">
  <data key="d3">The policy's expiration date sets a deadline by which any conversion action must occur, making the ability to convert contingent upon timing relative to the end date.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="4be01c39-3ab4-4261-b37d-cbe719e0f8f1" target="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">has expiration date</data>
</edge>
