<edge source="163ecb38-9f43-4a25-92c7-e5a3e53c0436" target="f1f93f22-6917-4b4f-977a-73f1acc6b748">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">rider</data>
</edge>
<edge source="163ecb38-9f43-4a25-92c7-e5a3e53c0436" target="645acca1-d926-4341-9284-523c924b580f">
  <data key="d3">The Waiver of Premium Rider uses the concept of Disability to justify免除 annual premium payments when the insured meets the specified incapacity conditions.</data>
  <data key="d4">applies to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="163ecb38-9f43-4a25-92c7-e5a3e53c0436" target="f4d7d65a-2757-4f6a-a581-628d6583aff0">
  <data key="d3">Rider 1, named "Waiver of Premium Due to Disability," is a provision that eliminates annual payments when the insured becomes disabled. This rider costs $102 per year, reflecting its specific financial terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">costs</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="163ecb38-9f43-4a25-92c7-e5a3e53c0436" target="2e5a669a-0eb1-4593-9d03-afb101531af9">
  <data key="d3">Rider 1 allows premium waivers when the insured is disabled, but requires annual proof of continued disability to sustain the benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="163ecb38-9f43-4a25-92c7-e5a3e53c0436" target="2bf72187-e922-4864-8481-8171333a1cb9">
  <data key="d3">The existence of the premium waiver under Rider 1 ensures continued coverage even after disability onset, meaning the policy’s protections remain intact without further payments.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="163ecb38-9f43-4a25-92c7-e5a3e53c0436" target="b8ea9b97-e6e5-4489-be08-3c5ea87c5638">
  <data key="d3">Rider 1's function—a premium waiver due to disability—is confirmed by the explicit mention of its $102 annual premium, which aligns with the policy’s stated terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="163ecb38-9f43-4a25-92c7-e5a3e53c0436" target="b268c72e-1272-4e20-9941-6431b25ee80f">
  <data key="d3">Rider 1’s premium waiver applies when the insured becomes disabled, and continues until they recover, resume employment, or turn 65, ensuring ongoing protection without cost during prolonged incapacity.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="163ecb38-9f43-4a25-92c7-e5a3e53c0436" target="46cb3cb8-08d3-4e7b-b4bd-f8bf8ce53a84">
  <data key="d3">Rider 1 enables full waiver of future premiums upon qualification due to disability, as confirmed by fact_sentence_2, reinforcing the practical application of the rider's provision.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="163ecb38-9f43-4a25-92c7-e5a3e53c0436" target="f5a046c9-ad3b-4851-b4b9-55480dcafc4f">
  <data key="d3">The waiver-of-premium rider depends on a sustained disability period; without meeting the six-month continuous disability threshold, the rider's benefit cannot be activated.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="163ecb38-9f43-4a25-92c7-e5a3e53c0436" target="a2bbbaf5-eb1b-4b1c-b8bd-f47818cd9768">
  <data key="d3">The waiver of premiums due to disability depends on the insured becoming totally disabled prior to age 60, making this temporal criterion essential for activating the rider's benefit described in fact_sentence_1.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
