<edge source="f4d7d65a-2757-4f6a-a581-628d6583aff0" target="645acca1-d926-4341-9284-523c924b580f">
  <data key="d3">The $102 annual premium for Rider 1 reflects the financial commitment required to maintain coverage that waives payments when the insured meets the Disability definition.</data>
  <data key="d4">funding</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f4d7d65a-2757-4f6a-a581-628d6583aff0" target="cc835297-ad62-4efc-ba70-0fcb4aa503f7">
  <data key="d3">The $102 annual premium for Rider 1 reflects the financial commitment tied to coverage that activates when the insured meets specific conditions, including those related to Chronic Illness.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional dependency</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f4d7d65a-2757-4f6a-a581-628d6583aff0" target="163ecb38-9f43-4a25-92c7-e5a3e53c0436">
  <data key="d3">The $102 annual premium corresponds to Rider 1, which waives future premiums if the insured becomes disabled and unable to work, ensuring continued coverage under specified conditions.</data>
  <data key="d4">funding</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f4d7d65a-2757-4f6a-a581-628d6583aff0" target="f5a046c9-ad3b-4851-b4b9-55480dcafc4f">
  <data key="d3">The premium waiver under Rider 1 depends on the insured meeting a six-month continuous disability requirement, which ensures the benefit is not triggered by short-term incapacity.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f4d7d65a-2757-4f6a-a581-628d6583aff0" target="a2bbbaf5-eb1b-4b1c-b8bd-f47818cd9768">
  <data key="d3">The premium waiver feature in Rider 1 depends on the insured becoming totally disabled prior to age 60, meaning the benefit only triggers under this time-bound condition.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f4d7d65a-2757-4f6a-a581-628d6583aff0" target="b8ea9b97-e6e5-4489-be08-3c5ea87c5638">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 specifies the $102 annual premium for Rider 1, which is explicitly identified in fact_sentence_2 as the Waiver of Premium due to Disability. This clarifies the financial obligation tied to the rider’s benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">1.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f4d7d65a-2757-4f6a-a581-628d6583aff0" target="46cb3cb8-08d3-4e7b-b4bd-f8bf8ce53a84">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 specifies the $102 annual premium for Rider 1, which enables the waiver provision detailed in fact_sentence_2 when disability occurs.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f4d7d65a-2757-4f6a-a581-628d6583aff0" target="2e5a669a-0eb1-4593-9d03-afb101531af9">
  <data key="d3">Rider 1's premium waiver depends on submitting annual proof of continued disability, which ensures eligibility for the waived $102 premium.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f4d7d65a-2757-4f6a-a581-628d6583aff0" target="2bf72187-e922-4864-8481-8171333a1cb9">
  <data key="d3">Rider 1's $102 annual premium is waived upon disability, ensuring continuous coverage without interruption, thus maintaining the rider’s intended protection.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
