</edge>
<edge source="b8ea9b97-e6e5-4489-be08-3c5ea87c5638" target="f5a046c9-ad3b-4851-b4b9-55480dcafc4f">
  <data key="d3">The $102 annual premium for the Waiver of Premium due to Disability rider depends on the insured satisfying the 6-month continuous disability requirement. Without fulfilling this condition, the premium would not trigger any benefit usage.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b8ea9b97-e6e5-4489-be08-3c5ea87c5638" target="2bf72187-e922-4864-8481-8171333a1cb9">
  <data key="d3">Rider 1 requires an annual premium of $102, ensuring continued coverage when a disability triggers the waiver provision.</data>
  <data key="d4">pays for</data>
