  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 identifies the $102 annual cost of the Waiver of Premium rider, which contributes directly to the total annual premium of $1,089 detailed in fact_sentence_1, demonstrating its role in the comprehensive policy pricing.</data>
  <data key="d4">contributes to</data>
