<edge source="46cb3cb8-08d3-4e7b-b4bd-f8bf8ce53a84" target="b8ea9b97-e6e5-4489-be08-3c5ea87c5638">
  <data key="d3">If the insured meets the qualification for disability, they receive full premium waivers under Rider 1, making the upfront $102 annual cost a worthwhile investment for ongoing protection against future financial burden.</data>
