<edge source="d0d2ce43-5e55-4cc3-9f0f-81e63f182a2b" target="773ac2bf-c8ee-48e5-99a2-8dedd0ce52c9">
  <data key="d3">The $500,000 ceiling on advances from Rider 2 applies specifically to cases where the insured is terminally ill, limiting how much can be drawn despite potential higher percentages of the total death benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">captured by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d0d2ce43-5e55-4cc3-9f0f-81e63f182a2b" target="c5bd960b-0752-414d-aad3-97a1a305bf96">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 defines the highest allowable advance under Rider 2, establishing the ceiling beyond which no further funds may be accessed. This complements fact_sentence_1 by completing the range of available amounts.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d0d2ce43-5e55-4cc3-9f0f-81e63f182a2b" target="fff349a0-c2b3-4147-8048-0595272170a0">
  <data key="d3">The maximum advance of $500,000 under Rider 2 is subject to annual reductions based on an actuarial discount of about 8%, meaning its realizable value diminishes each year.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d0d2ce43-5e55-4cc3-9f0f-81e63f182a2b" target="1444f482-e5d8-4338-b319-a970f9d01ed9">
  <data key="d3">Rider 2 allows a maximum advance of $500,000, which reduces the total death benefit available. Upon the insured's death, any remaining balance of the original death benefit is paid out to beneficiaries.</data>
  <data key="d4">reduces benefit</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d0d2ce43-5e55-4cc3-9f0f-81e63f182a2b" target="c37a8c56-c455-4223-bf63-099ad8e97416">
  <data key="d3">Rider 2's $500,000 maximum advance capability aligns with the broader purpose of the policy—providing substantial financial support—and helps justify the inclusion of additional riders in the total premium of $1,089.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
