  <data key="d3">Although the accelerated death benefit for terminal illness incurs no additional premium, it is subject to an annual actuarial discount reducing the payout by about 8%, reflecting the insurer’s adjustment for earlier claim timing.</data>
  <data key="d4">actuarial adjustment</data>
