<edge source="586acb2a-853b-4ebd-8a84-7e996761219c" target="5a454711-2bc0-411b-9675-9c153582bf13">
  <data key="d3">Rider 3 requires a yearly premium of $48 for chronic illness access, unlike Rider 2, which grants terminal illness acceleration at no added charge. Their differences lie in cost and qualifying medical conditions.</data>
  <data key="d4">differs in cost</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="586acb2a-853b-4ebd-8a84-7e996761219c" target="8939b21f-f68d-40db-89a6-72aed8a58ea7">
  <data key="d3">The annual premium of $48 for the Chronic Illness Accelerated Death Benefit rider enables the policyholder to receive monthly payments based on a percentage of the face amount.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="586acb2a-853b-4ebd-8a84-7e996761219c" target="25532b26-15cf-439e-81bb-d1a42ef63fe9">
  <data key="d3">The annual premium of $48 for the chronic illness accelerated death benefit rider depends on the policyholder's qualification under specified medical conditions.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="586acb2a-853b-4ebd-8a84-7e996761219c" target="4d5748a6-95ed-4858-bcb7-b5522f2bccfb">
  <data key="d3">The annual premium of $48 for the chronic illness accelerated death benefit depends on the policyholder meeting qualification criteria, including having a certified chronic illness diagnosis from a licensed healthcare provider.</data>
  <data key="d4">precondition</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="586acb2a-853b-4ebd-8a84-7e996761219c" target="9074adae-f9ba-4a37-87a1-710b818029e7">
  <data key="d3">The annual premium for the Chronic Illness Accelerated Death Benefit rider is $48, and any advance payments made under it are not reduced by actuarial discounts, meaning full face amount may be accessed without adjustment based on mortality risk.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="586acb2a-853b-4ebd-8a84-7e996761219c" target="c37a8c56-c455-4223-bf63-099ad8e97416">
  <data key="d3">The total annual premium of $1,089 in fact_sentence_1 incorporates the $48 yearly cost of the Chronic Illness rider described in fact_sentence_2, confirming its inclusion within the overall expense.</data>
  <data key="d4">contributes to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="a4ce89e9-71b3-4b46-825e-5335b08216c2" target="586acb2a-853b-4ebd-8a84-7e996761219c">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">has annual premium</data>
</edge>
