<edge source="8939b21f-f68d-40db-89a6-72aed8a58ea7" target="586acb2a-853b-4ebd-8a84-7e996761219c">
  <data key="d3">The availability of up to 2% of the face amount per month under the Chronic Illness rider depends on paying the specified annual premium of $48.</data>
  <data key="d4">required for</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8939b21f-f68d-40db-89a6-72aed8a58ea7" target="25532b26-15cf-439e-81bb-d1a42ef63fe9">
  <data key="d3">The availability of up to 2% of the face amount per month under Rider 3 depends on the insured meeting the chronic illness qualification criterion.</data>
  <data key="d4">payment conditioned on eligibility</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8939b21f-f68d-40db-89a6-72aed8a58ea7" target="f18fc48e-98d0-411b-90bf-83eff84b25c4">
  <data key="d3">Rider 3 allows up to 2% of the policy's face amount per month, typically payable upon meeting predefined medical criteria like inability to perform key activities of daily living, linking it directly to the listed functions.</data>
  <data key="d4">justified by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8939b21f-f68d-40db-89a6-72aed8a58ea7" target="63574a8d-028b-4e11-96b6-a8a861f0e4a5">
  <data key="d3">Rider 3 allows monthly advances of up to 2% of the face amount, ensuring controlled periodic access. This monthly limit ensures that the total advanced over time remains within the 50% cap set by the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">constrains</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8939b21f-f68d-40db-89a6-72aed8a58ea7" target="4d5748a6-95ed-4858-bcb7-b5522f2bccfb">
  <data key="d3">The monthly payment limit under Rider 3 depends on prior confirmation by a licensed healthcare provider that the insured meets chronic illness criteria.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8939b21f-f68d-40db-89a6-72aed8a58ea7" target="9074adae-f9ba-4a37-87a1-710b818029e7">
  <data key="d3">Rider 3 allows monthly advances of up to 2% of the face amount, and since no actuarial discount is applied, each advance fully reflects the policy’s underlying value without reduction based on mortality risk.</data>
  <data key="d4">no discount applies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="8939b21f-f68d-40db-89a6-72aed8a58ea7" target="c37a8c56-c455-4223-bf63-099ad8e97416">
  <data key="d3">Rider 3 enables partial access to the policy’s cash value through monthly disbursements, justifying its inclusion in the expanded premium totaling $1,089 annually.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
