<edge source="b9e4e6cd-498c-4d66-a4db-e3de40d42c88" target="6f60dab4-f234-4682-8be6-3a5b44c9ed85">
  <data key="d3">Rider 4 covers children from birth or adoption until age 25. At age 25, they gain the right to convert to an individual policy without needing to prove good health.</data>
