<edge source="d85e868a-f03c-4843-904f-562570994fbd" target="9b19b8c2-d328-414e-b271-76cab099ce37">
  <data key="d3">The 90-day window ensures timely validation of causation; without a direct link from the accident to death within this period, the claim would not qualify.</data>
  <data key="d4">timely causation</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d85e868a-f03c-4843-904f-562570994fbd" target="4351e296-ad01-4b03-8073-cffdc596ce2d">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that death occur within 90 days aligns with the condition that the accident must be the direct cause, together defining precise eligibility for the accidental death benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d85e868a-f03c-4843-904f-562570994fbd" target="8ea7b659-7380-42ed-b6f1-e4cffbb45c59">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that death occur within 90 days of an accident complements the exclusion of suicide, together defining clear boundaries for claim eligibility under the accidental death benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d85e868a-f03c-4843-904f-562570994fbd" target="8f0204f1-a4f1-4add-9ba8-59760c0094b2">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that death occur within 90 days of an accident complements the exclusion of self-inflicted injury, ensuring claims are both timely and not due to intentional acts.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d85e868a-f03c-4843-904f-562570994fbd" target="b938585a-fc9e-4358-bb77-95bbcf1e1f31">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 states that death under Rider 5 must occur within 90 days of the accident, aligning exactly with fact_sentence_2’s condition for receiving the accidental death benefit, thus reinforcing the same requirement.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">1.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d85e868a-f03c-4843-904f-562570994fbd" target="80f0a3df-332f-4526-af6f-c0a508f1d61f">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 enforces a 90-day deadline after an accident for death claims under Rider 5, which matches the condition stated in fact_sentence_2 for receiving the $750,000 accidental death benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d85e868a-f03c-4843-904f-562570994fbd" target="c9a479ac-a21d-4893-8d96-0ee391ee4cb0">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that death occur within 90 days of an accident is qualified further by the exclusion of war-related causes, narrowing the set of eligible incidents for the accidental death benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">compliments with</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d85e868a-f03c-4843-904f-562570994fbd" target="58b732d1-91fb-4e00-8dd8-6c20dca4bfb3">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that death must occur within 90 days of an accident is overridden when the accident involves aviation duties, making such cases ineligible regardless of timing.</data>
  <data key="d4">excludes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d85e868a-f03c-4843-904f-562570994fbd" target="aedfd2a5-0d7e-477f-952c-d53e51f6f0f2">
  <data key="d3">The requirement that death occur within 90 days aligns with the exclusion of claims when intoxication is involved, ensuring both timeliness and behavioral integrity in claiming the accidental death benefit.</data>
