<edge source="5043b1c0-84fc-433c-a7be-9218b8545f5d" target="92f0d544-ff95-4002-8c1e-cce1e2ed72b1">
  <data key="d3">The base policy's annual premium of $94 forms the foundation of the overall cost. When combined with the premiums for included riders, particularly the Guaranteed Insurability Rider, the total becomes $1,089 per year.</data>
  <data key="d4">adds to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
