  <data key="d3">The base annual premium of $94 contributes to the overall cost of maintaining coverage, and if payment is delayed beyond the due date, the policy enters a grace period where coverage continues—but any unpaid portion may later reduce the death benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
