  <data key="d3">The death benefit expires at age 70, though the underlying policy continues to be renewable through age 95, meaning coverage may persist without underwriting despite loss of the specific benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">limits</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
