<edge source="d617fcfa-ca1a-42af-b96a-3031b196a810" target="4351e296-ad01-4b03-8073-cffdc596ce2d">
  <data key="d3">RIDER 6 provides a pathway to increase coverage without medical exams, which may help ensure sufficient funds are available should an accident result in death, aligning with the conditions set for the accidental death benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">enhances</data>
