  <data key="d3">The availability of the Guaranteed Insurability Rider—allowing new coverage without medical exams—may encourage timely action within the same 90-day window relevant to qualifying for the accidental death benefit.</data>
  <data key="d4">time sensitive complement</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
