<edge source="44e0a4ac-db25-49f7-aa54-1d094f1c0708" target="177ee328-91d5-42c3-be6e-22a540d6f1cb">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 describes the availability of extra coverage through RIDER 6, but its usability depends on timely action. Fact_sentence_2 enforces a deadline—90 days after an option date—which determines whether the opportunity in fact_sentence_1 can actually be exercised.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="44e0a4ac-db25-49f7-aa54-1d094f1c0708" target="fd499eef-7e7e-4325-9622-d0c882722492">
  <data key="d3">RIDER 6 enables the addition of up to $100,000 in coverage at specific times, but the actual premium for such additions is contingent upon the insured's current age and health-based risk profile when exercised.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="44e0a4ac-db25-49f7-aa54-1d094f1c0708" target="9f917507-b0ee-48c4-98b8-f7fc168084ef">
  <data key="d3">The ability to purchase extra coverage via RIDER 6 is restricted by age; once the insured turns 50, no further options under this rider may be exercised.</data>
  <data key="d4">limits</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="44e0a4ac-db25-49f7-aa54-1d094f1c0708" target="92f0d544-ff95-4002-8c1e-cce1e2ed72b1">
  <data key="d3">Additional coverage under the rider increases the policy’s scope, contributing to the final total premium. This explains why the combined premium reflects inclusion of such options.</data>
  <data key="d4">contributes to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="44e0a4ac-db25-49f7-aa54-1d094f1c0708" target="c37a8c56-c455-4223-bf63-099ad8e97416">
  <data key="d3">The availability of additional coverage through rider options explains part of why the total annual premium reaches $1,089, linking the expanded benefits to the increased cost.</data>
  <data key="d4">explains cost</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="44e0a4ac-db25-49f7-aa54-1d094f1c0708" target="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c">
  <data key="d3">The availability of increased coverage via RIDER 6 depends on the policy remaining active, so its utility ends when the policy expires on July 12, 2054.</data>
  <data key="d4">limited by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
