  <data key="d3">Age 43 is one of the designated option dates for exercising the Guaranteed Insurability Option (RIDER 6), which carries an annual premium of $89.</data>
  <data key="d4">applies to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="48571610-7269-4220-a825-c8f2945f622d" target="d617fcfa-ca1a-42af-b96a-3031b196a810">
  <data key="d3">Age 43 serves as a qualified opportunity to exercise the rider’s privilege of obtaining additional coverage without medical underwriting.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="48571610-7269-4220-a825-c8f2945f622d" target="44e0a4ac-db25-49f7-aa54-1d094f1c0708">
  <data key="d3">Age 43 serves as a defined option date allowing the exercise of RIDER 6, enabling the acquisition of up to $100,000 in additional coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">applies to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="48571610-7269-4220-a825-c8f2945f622d" target="5f90df18-58e5-4575-9e58-d2c545796976">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 lists age 43 as a qualifying event for RIDER 6, which aligns with fact_sentence_1's mention of age 40 as another permitted option date, forming part of a set of available triggers.</data>
  <data key="d4">exemplifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="48571610-7269-4220-a825-c8f2945f622d" target="b8cb3948-8eb7-4978-b2b6-d2d8621a4b18">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 identifies one of several potential ages when the Guaranteed Insurability Rider may be exercised. Fact sentence 2 adds another such age, expanding on the range of available options under the same rider.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="48571610-7269-4220-a825-c8f2945f622d" target="247febe6-9b75-43a5-b350-13e76dd99201">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 identifies one eligible age (43) for exercising RIDER 6, while fact sentence 2 specifies another (46). Both contribute to defining the full set of possible exercise opportunities under the rider.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="48571610-7269-4220-a825-c8f2945f622d" target="fd499eef-7e7e-4325-9622-d0c882722492">
  <data key="d3">Age 43 serves as a designated opportunity to activate the rider; however, the actual premium amount for added coverage hinges on the insured's condition when the rider is exercised.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="48571610-7269-4220-a825-c8f2945f622d" target="177ee328-91d5-42c3-be6e-22a540d6f1cb">
  <data key="d3">Age 43 is designated as an option date under the rider, triggering the window during which the insured may increase coverage. This eligibility leads directly to the requirement to act within 90 days to secure the additional coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="48571610-7269-4220-a825-c8f2945f622d" target="9c4cc2e2-e0dd-43cc-9162-2c30fb8592d7">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 1 identifies reaching age 43 as a permissible time to increase coverage under the rider. This event complements fact sentence 2, which lists family milestones such as childbirth as another eligible occasion for exercising the rider's benefits.</data>
  <data key="d4">equivalent event</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="48571610-7269-4220-a825-c8f2945f622d" target="9f917507-b0ee-48c4-98b8-f7fc168084ef">
  <data key="d3">The ability to exercise options under RIDER 6 at age 43 is subject to termination once the insured turns 50, meaning the window for exercising such benefits closes after age 50.</data>
  <data key="d4">limits</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="48571610-7269-4220-a825-c8f2945f622d" target="d35ea843-3cf7-4434-abd8-5317e92704d1">
  <data key="d3">The ability to exercise the rider at age 43 relies on the policy being actively maintained, which is ensured by its guaranteed renewability up to age 95.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="48571610-7269-4220-a825-c8f2945f622d" target="f02ad15a-f220-4368-928b-f055e35cac36">
  <data key="d3">The availability of a specific option date (age 43) for the rider enables future increases in coverage, while the ability to convert parts of the policy provides another avenue for adjusting benefits later. These provisions together enhance long-term adaptability of the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
