  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 lists age 46 as an option date for RIDER 6, complementing fact sentence 1's mention of age 43. Together, they outline multiple potential times when additional coverage can be purchased.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
