</edge>
<edge source="b8cb3948-8eb7-4978-b2b6-d2d8621a4b18" target="9f917507-b0ee-48c4-98b8-f7fc168084ef">
  <data key="d3">The availability of options under RIDER 6 culminates at age 49, after which they cease entirely due to automatic termination at age 50.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b8cb3948-8eb7-4978-b2b6-d2d8621a4b18" target="92f0d544-ff95-4002-8c1e-cce1e2ed72b1">
  <data key="d3">Age 49 is a designated option date for exercising the Guaranteed Insurability Rider, allowing additional coverage purchase. This rider contributes to the overall annual premium amount stated in the second sentence.</data>
