<edge source="177ee328-91d5-42c3-be6e-22a540d6f1cb" target="b938585a-fc9e-4358-bb77-95bbcf1e1f31">
  <data key="d3">Fact 2 outlines a requirement to act within 90 days when eligible for extra coverage under a rider. Fact 1 sets a separate condition requiring death to happen within 90 days of an accident to trigger benefits. Though both reference 90-day periods, they govern distinct policy mechanisms.</data>
  <data key="d4">time dependent</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="177ee328-91d5-42c3-be6e-22a540d6f1cb" target="87951d9a-26b1-4d25-a8f2-239ec1d0ae52">
  <data key="d3">To activate the $89 annual premium benefit tied to the rider, the insured must act within 90 days of an option date; otherwise, the chance to add coverage expires.</data>
  <data key="d4">required for</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="177ee328-91d5-42c3-be6e-22a540d6f1cb" target="d617fcfa-ca1a-42af-b96a-3031b196a810">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to act within 90 days ensures that the ability to buy coverage without underwriting through RIDER 6 remains viable and enforceable.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="177ee328-91d5-42c3-be6e-22a540d6f1cb" target="44e0a4ac-db25-49f7-aa54-1d094f1c0708">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 imposes a time limit for purchasing additional coverage, making it essential for realizing the provision described in fact_sentence_1. Without meeting this deadline, the ability to add up to $100,000 in coverage under RIDER 6 becomes void.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="177ee328-91d5-42c3-be6e-22a540d6f1cb" target="5f90df18-58e5-4575-9e58-d2c545796976">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to exercise the rider within 90 days stems from specific option dates such as age 40, ensuring timely action when the right becomes available.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditions</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="177ee328-91d5-42c3-be6e-22a540d6f1cb" target="48571610-7269-4220-a825-c8f2945f622d">
  <data key="d3">The obligation to exercise the rider within 90 days applies specifically to each option date, such as age 43, ensuring timely action after becoming eligible.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="177ee328-91d5-42c3-be6e-22a540d6f1cb" target="247febe6-9b75-43a5-b350-13e76dd99201">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to act within 90 days applies specifically to each option date, including age 46, ensuring timely exercise of the rider’s benefits.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditions</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="177ee328-91d5-42c3-be6e-22a540d6f1cb" target="b8cb3948-8eb7-4978-b2b6-d2d8621a4b18">
  <data key="d3">To take advantage of the increased coverage offered at age 49, the insured must initiate the purchase process within 90 days of reaching that option date; otherwise, the chance expires.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="177ee328-91d5-42c3-be6e-22a540d6f1cb" target="9c4cc2e2-e0dd-43cc-9162-2c30fb8592d7">
  <data key="d3">To qualify for increased coverage under the rider, the insured must act promptly—specifically within 90 days—after qualifying events like childbirth, ensuring timely utilization of the option.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="177ee328-91d5-42c3-be6e-22a540d6f1cb" target="fd499eef-7e7e-4325-9622-d0c882722492">
  <data key="d3">Exercising the rider within the required timeframe ensures eligibility for additional coverage, upon which the premium is calculated based on the insured’s current age and health status at the time of purchase.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional dependency</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="177ee328-91d5-42c3-be6e-22a540d6f1cb" target="9f917507-b0ee-48c4-98b8-f7fc168084ef">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to act within 90 days on purchasing additional coverage depends on the rider being active; however, once the insured turns 50, the rider terminates, making such actions impossible thereafter.</data>
  <data key="d4">limits</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="177ee328-91d5-42c3-be6e-22a540d6f1cb" target="c37a8c56-c455-4223-bf63-099ad8e97416">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to act within 90 days on additional coverage options aligns with the rider details contributing to the overall premium stated in the first fact.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="177ee328-91d5-42c3-be6e-22a540d6f1cb" target="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c">
  <data key="d3">While the policy expires in 2054, its terms allow for incremental increases in coverage through a rider that requires action within 90 days of specific triggers, ensuring continued adaptability even as the original term nears conclusion.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="fff922b1-49eb-4ebc-83c6-b24ae7a62728" target="177ee328-91d5-42c3-be6e-22a540d6f1cb">
