  <data key="d3">The premium for extra coverage obtained using RIDER 6 is influenced by the individual’s age and risk profile, which helps explain why the rider carries a baseline annual fee of $89.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="fd499eef-7e7e-4325-9622-d0c882722492" target="d617fcfa-ca1a-42af-b96a-3031b196a810">
  <data key="d3">The premium for additional coverage through RIDER 6 is set according to the insured’s present age and risk classification, reflecting why the rider requires no medical exam—it relies on predefined rates tied to demographic and actuarial factors.</data>
  <data key="d4">determines cost</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="fd499eef-7e7e-4325-9622-d0c882722492" target="44e0a4ac-db25-49f7-aa54-1d094f1c0708">
  <data key="d3">The premium amount for increased coverage under RIDER 6 is influenced by the insured’s age and risk classification at the moment they choose to add coverage, making it dependent on the eligibility conditions outlined in the rider.</data>
  <data key="d4">drives cost</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="fd499eef-7e7e-4325-9622-d0c882722492" target="5f90df18-58e5-4575-9e58-d2c545796976">
  <data key="d3">The premium amount for additional coverage under RIDER 6 is influenced by the insured’s age and risk class upon exercise—making age 40 a relevant milestone for determining such costs.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="fd499eef-7e7e-4325-9622-d0c882722492" target="48571610-7269-4220-a825-c8f2945f622d">
  <data key="d3">The premium for additional coverage under RIDER 6 varies based on the insured’s age and risk profile at exercise time, making timely decisions—such as those available at age 43—critical for favorable rates.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="fd499eef-7e7e-4325-9622-d0c882722492" target="247febe6-9b75-43a5-b350-13e76dd99201">
  <data key="d3">The premium amount for additional coverage under RIDER 6 is based on the insured’s age and risk class at the time of purchase, making it essential to consider timing—such as at age 46—to manage costs effectively.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="fd499eef-7e7e-4325-9622-d0c882722492" target="b8cb3948-8eb7-4978-b2b6-d2d8621a4b18">
  <data key="d3">When the insured exercises RIDER 6 at age 49, the resulting premium is set according to their actual age and risk classification at that moment.</data>
  <data key="d4">determined by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="fd499eef-7e7e-4325-9622-d0c882722492" target="9c4cc2e2-e0dd-43cc-9162-2c30fb8592d7">
  <data key="d3">When exercising RIDER 6 after a qualifying event like childbirth, the premium amount is influenced by the insured’s current age and risk profile, making such events essential prerequisites for accessing new coverage terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on event</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="fd499eef-7e7e-4325-9622-d0c882722492" target="177ee328-91d5-42c3-be6e-22a540d6f1cb">
  <data key="d3">The need to determine the premium using current age and risk classification necessitates that the rider be exercised promptly—within 90 days—to ensure accurate underwriting evaluation before changes occur.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="fd499eef-7e7e-4325-9622-d0c882722492" target="9f917507-b0ee-48c4-98b8-f7fc168084ef">
  <data key="d3">The premium rate for extra coverage under RIDER 6 depends on the insured's current age and health status when they choose to add coverage. However, such opportunities cease entirely once the insured reaches age 50.</data>
  <data key="d4">terminates at age 50</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="fd499eef-7e7e-4325-9622-d0c882722492" target="92f0d544-ff95-4002-8c1e-cce1e2ed72b1">
  <data key="d3">The premium for additional coverage through the rider depends on current age and risk profile when exercised, contributing to the overall premium sum stated in the base policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">contributes to</data>
