  <data key="d3">The conditions governing the rider’s use—based on age and risk classification—are relevant because they determine whether the insured could increase coverage prior to the policy’s expiration in 2054, making the expiration date functionally significant for rider utilization.</data>
  <data key="d4">influences</data>
