  <data key="d3">The termination of RIDER 6 at age 50 renders its associated $89 annual premium irrelevant beyond that point, even though premiums may still be paid.</data>
  <data key="d4">limits use of</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9f917507-b0ee-48c4-98b8-f7fc168084ef" target="d617fcfa-ca1a-42af-b96a-3031b196a810">
  <data key="d3">Once the insured turns 50, they lose access to purchasing further coverage via RIDER 6, regardless of prior eligibility.</data>
  <data key="d4">terminates access</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9f917507-b0ee-48c4-98b8-f7fc168084ef" target="44e0a4ac-db25-49f7-aa54-1d094f1c0708">
  <data key="d3">The termination of RIDER 6 options at age 50 limits the window during which additional coverage can be acquired, effectively capping access to the benefits outlined in the earlier statement.</data>
  <data key="d4">terminates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9f917507-b0ee-48c4-98b8-f7fc168084ef" target="5f90df18-58e5-4575-9e58-d2c545796976">
  <data key="d3">Options available through RIDER 6 end at age 50, meaning any opportunity to use them—including at age 40—is constrained by this upper limit.</data>
  <data key="d4">limits window of availability</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9f917507-b0ee-48c4-98b8-f7fc168084ef" target="48571610-7269-4220-a825-c8f2945f622d">
  <data key="d3">Options available under RIDER 6, including those at age 43, expire entirely when the insured reaches age 50, thereby restricting any future use beyond that point.</data>
  <data key="d4">terminates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9f917507-b0ee-48c4-98b8-f7fc168084ef" target="247febe6-9b75-43a5-b350-13e76dd99201">
  <data key="d3">Options under RIDER 6 end at age 50, thereby terminating any opportunity to use earlier available options, including the one at age 46.</data>
  <data key="d4">terminates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9f917507-b0ee-48c4-98b8-f7fc168084ef" target="b8cb3948-8eb7-4978-b2b6-d2d8621a4b18">
  <data key="d3">Options under RIDER 6 expire at age 50, making age 49 the last possible moment to utilize them.</data>
  <data key="d4">follows</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
