<edge source="9f62f637-e863-44b4-96e3-ef56704f581c" target="ff41a674-10ac-4c9e-a832-459e288b75df">
  <data key="d3">While the annual premium is scheduled for July 12, the option to pay quarterly provides an alternate method for meeting the financial commitment, allowing policyholders greater control over cash flow without altering the overall yearly cost.</data>
  <data key="d4">alternative option</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9f62f637-e863-44b4-96e3-ef56704f581c" target="219bffde-d1a5-460e-82a7-164eb4b6a157">
  <data key="d3">While quarterly payments are available upon request, the standard and primary method of premium payment is annual. This reflects a supplementary payment choice alongside the main annual plan.</data>
  <data key="d4">alternative to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9f62f637-e863-44b4-96e3-ef56704f581c" target="03f96a62-9cac-4ba6-9b09-3d1ac7656341">
  <data key="d3">Fact sentence 2 mentions quarterly payment availability upon request. Fact sentence 1 adds that monthly payments are similarly accessible when requested, showing complementary flexibility in payment scheduling.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="9f62f637-e863-44b4-96e3-ef56704f581c" target="5056bd4e-5477-4eaf-bb15-46b84bab7d04">
  <data key="d3">The availability of quarterly payments provides alternative scheduling for premiums, while the 31-day grace period ensures ongoing coverage if a payment is delayed beyond the due date. These features together support flexible payment management.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
