<edge source="e6de81af-aa16-485d-9cca-a6d0499ae0d5" target="92f0d544-ff95-4002-8c1e-cce1e2ed72b1">
  <data key="d3">Coverage remaining active during the grace period means the insured retains benefits despite late payment. This continuity depends on having met prior obligations, such as paying the full annual premium of $1,089 before the due date.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e6de81af-aa16-485d-9cca-a6d0499ae0d5" target="ff41a674-10ac-4c9e-a832-459e288b75df">
  <data key="d3">Because coverage stays active during the grace period, it creates a window in which the annual premium—due on July 12—can still be paid without losing benefits.</data>
  <data key="d4">follows</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e6de81af-aa16-485d-9cca-a6d0499ae0d5" target="219bffde-d1a5-460e-82a7-164eb4b6a157">
  <data key="d3">The existence of a grace period depends on the established payment schedule; because premiums are due annually, the insurer provides a 31-day buffer post-due date before coverage lapses, maintaining protection under specific conditions.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e6de81af-aa16-485d-9cca-a6d0499ae0d5" target="5056bd4e-5477-4eaf-bb15-46b84bab7d04">
  <data key="d3">Continued coverage during the grace period depends on the presence of a defined 31-day extension window post-due date.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e6de81af-aa16-485d-9cca-a6d0499ae0d5" target="9c3e6312-c3f4-4a65-ae25-1fdcea64f33e">
  <data key="d3">The grace period maintains active coverage, ensuring that claims made during this window are eligible for payment after adjustments. As such, any death occurring during the grace period triggers a reduction in benefits due to outstanding premiums.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e6de81af-aa16-485d-9cca-a6d0499ae0d5" target="c37a8c56-c455-4223-bf63-099ad8e97416">
  <data key="d3">The existence of a grace period maintains policy coverage beyond the scheduled payment date, supporting the stability implied by the fixed annual premium stated in the first fact.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="e6de81af-aa16-485d-9cca-a6d0499ae0d5" target="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c">
  <data key="d3">The existence of a grace period means that despite the policy expiring on July 12, 2054, it remains effective past that date for one month, allowing flexibility before termination.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
