<edge source="d35ea843-3cf7-4434-abd8-5317e92704d1" target="024f312c-2a82-4c4b-9492-447ba61bada0">
  <data key="d3">Although the policy remains guaranteed renewable until age 95, its accidental death benefit is terminated once the insured turns 70, limiting the payout scope over time.</data>
  <data key="d4">extends beyond</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d35ea843-3cf7-4434-abd8-5317e92704d1" target="d617fcfa-ca1a-42af-b96a-3031b196a810">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s guaranteed renewability until age 95 ensures ongoing availability of the rider benefits, allowing the insured to exercise options for increased coverage throughout their lifetime.</data>
  <data key="d4">enhances</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d35ea843-3cf7-4434-abd8-5317e92704d1" target="48571610-7269-4220-a825-c8f2945f622d">
  <data key="d3">Guaranteed renewability until age 95 supports the long-term viability of the rider’s option dates, including age 43, allowing future access to additional coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d35ea843-3cf7-4434-abd8-5317e92704d1" target="247febe6-9b75-43a5-b350-13e76dd99201">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s guaranteed renewability until age 95 enables the existence of specific option dates—like age 46—for adding additional coverage via the rider.</data>
  <data key="d4">required for</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d35ea843-3cf7-4434-abd8-5317e92704d1" target="b8cb3948-8eb7-4978-b2b6-d2d8621a4b18">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s guaranteed renewability until age 95 supports ongoing eligibility for rider provisions, such as those applicable at age 49.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables access</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d35ea843-3cf7-4434-abd8-5317e92704d1" target="f02ad15a-f220-4368-928b-f055e35cac36">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s guaranteed renewability until age 95 ensures ongoing protection, enabling the policyholder to consider converting coverage later without risk of denial due to health changes.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d35ea843-3cf7-4434-abd8-5317e92704d1" target="1c39a3e5-e052-494d-ba68-54005783ca3f">
  <data key="d3">The policy's guaranteed renewability until age 95 ensures continued coverage, which necessitates periodic premium payments subject to adjustment based on the insurer’s renewal rate schedule.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d35ea843-3cf7-4434-abd8-5317e92704d1" target="c37a8c56-c455-4223-bf63-099ad8e97416">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s guaranteed renewability until age 95 justifies the sustained premium payment of $1,089 per year over decades.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d35ea843-3cf7-4434-abd8-5317e92704d1" target="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c">
  <data key="d3">While the policy is guaranteed renewable until age 95, it still has a defined expiration date of July 12, 2054, implying either a default termination unless renewed or a cap based on time rather than age alone.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d35ea843-3cf7-4434-abd8-5317e92704d1" target="b3e12914-fba7-442d-8f31-2161867e424e">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 specifies that the policy is guaranteed renewable until age 95, which aligns exactly with fact_sentence_2's assertion. This reinforces the permanence of coverage under the policy beyond standard term limits.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">1.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d35ea843-3cf7-4434-abd8-5317e92704d1" target="ac3feceb-a7e7-49d3-b0d9-b4f248709b5e">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee of renewability until age 95 enables sustained coverage, making the option to convert to permanent insurance later highly valuable and feasible under favorable terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d35ea843-3cf7-4434-abd8-5317e92704d1" target="6f9d5bb4-e0cd-4a27-94a4-c6105a8fa692">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee of renewability until age 95 enables the possibility of conversion, but fact_sentence_2 restricts this option to before age 70, making it a conditional subset of the longer-term flexibility.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d35ea843-3cf7-4434-abd8-5317e92704d1" target="c98a305d-6028-47a0-875f-d569080ab9a3">
  <data key="d3">The guaranteed renewability until age 95 complements the no-contest clause after two years by ensuring long-term policy continuity and reducing uncertainty about claim eligibility later in life.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d35ea843-3cf7-4434-abd8-5317e92704d1" target="a3c240d7-a2bf-45a9-8d80-9ad84d392456">
  <data key="d3">The lifelong renewability clause ensures ongoing eligibility for conversion, but the actual ability to convert ends no later than age 70, limiting when the insured may act on that option despite extended coverage availability.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d35ea843-3cf7-4434-abd8-5317e92704d1" target="900f0b4d-30af-4caf-993b-7b70536f6667">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee of renewability until age 95 provides long-term stability, enabling the inclusion of special waivers such as the aviation exclusion exemption based on personal circumstances.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d35ea843-3cf7-4434-abd8-5317e92704d1" target="64e3cf9e-d690-4b5b-9c5c-e6aff60fe010">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee of renewal until age 95 does not override specific exclusions such as death during military combat, maintaining operational boundaries despite extended policy duration.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d35ea843-3cf7-4434-abd8-5317e92704d1" target="97b70e0b-cf53-4c84-adbf-8397da3e2be9">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee of renewability until age 95 provides long-term stability to the policy, enabling the application of special provisions such as the aviation exclusion waiver tied to the insured’s flying activities.</data>
  <data key="d4">compliments with</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d35ea843-3cf7-4434-abd8-5317e92704d1" target="520ea8d4-9ede-4e65-88be-2ee9ab6039aa">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee of renewal until age 95 ensures sustained coverage eligibility, while the limited exception to the incontestability clause (non-payment of premiums) preserves insurer rights under financial lapse scenarios, creating a balanced framework for long-term policy integrity.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="d35ea843-3cf7-4434-abd8-5317e92704d1" target="fb8367db-a1ef-40f4-8f3b-2041da369dd7">
  <data key="d3">The guaranteed renewability clause ensures continued coverage through age 95, enabling the sustained application of the aviation exclusion waiver, which incurs an extra $175 yearly fee based on the insured’s flying activities.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="736dcbfa-50f8-472f-8b4b-a514ac69f170" target="d35ea843-3cf7-4434-abd8-5317e92704d1">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">within guaranteed renewal period</data>
</edge>
