  <data key="d3">The requirement for increasing renewal premiums reflects the long-term nature of the policy’s guaranteed renewability, ensuring financial sustainability beyond initial terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
