<edge source="f02ad15a-f220-4368-928b-f055e35cac36" target="d617fcfa-ca1a-42af-b96a-3031b196a810">
  <data key="d3">The right to convert all or part of the policy offers structural flexibility, which aligns with the purpose of Rider 6 enabling new coverage additions without underwriting scrutiny.</data>
  <data key="d4">enhances</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f02ad15a-f220-4368-928b-f055e35cac36" target="48571610-7269-4220-a825-c8f2945f622d">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s convertible nature offers flexibility in modifying coverage over time, including through optional upgrades such as those permitted at age 43 via the rider. This complements the rider's purpose by allowing strategic adjustments.</data>
  <data key="d4">enhances</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f02ad15a-f220-4368-928b-f055e35cac36" target="247febe6-9b75-43a5-b350-13e76dd99201">
  <data key="d3">The policy's convertible nature allows future changes to coverage type or amount, complementing the rider’s provision for increased coverage at certain milestones such as age 46.</data>
  <data key="d4">enhances</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f02ad15a-f220-4368-928b-f055e35cac36" target="d35ea843-3cf7-4434-abd8-5317e92704d1">
  <data key="d3">The ability to convert the policy supports long-term planning, especially when combined with the guarantee that it remains renewable until age 95.</data>
  <data key="d4">enhances</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f02ad15a-f220-4368-928b-f055e35cac36" target="c37a8c56-c455-4223-bf63-099ad8e97416">
  <data key="d3">The availability of conversion rights underscores why the policy carries a higher premium—this flexibility adds substantial value to the insured’s long-term planning.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f02ad15a-f220-4368-928b-f055e35cac36" target="4b0941c4-2ba4-47c4-820c-1ebace0a9c2c">
  <data key="d3">The option to convert the policy implies ongoing flexibility even after its initial term ends, but it cannot extend past the stated expiration date of July 12, 2054.</data>
  <data key="d4">limited by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f02ad15a-f220-4368-928b-f055e35cac36" target="b3e12914-fba7-442d-8f31-2161867e424e">
  <data key="d3">The ability to convert the policy relies on it being actively maintained through guaranteed renewability until age 95, making this feature essential for exercising conversion options.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f02ad15a-f220-4368-928b-f055e35cac36" target="ac3feceb-a7e7-49d3-b0d9-b4f248709b5e">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 establishes the right to convert policy coverage, and fact_sentence_2 clarifies that this process requires no medical examination or evidence of insurability, enhancing the practicality of the conversion option.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f02ad15a-f220-4368-928b-f055e35cac36" target="6f9d5bb4-e0cd-4a27-94a4-c6105a8fa692">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 establishes the right to convert the policy; fact_sentence_2 restricts this right to before the insured turns 70, defining its temporal boundary.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f02ad15a-f220-4368-928b-f055e35cac36" target="a3c240d7-a2bf-45a9-8d80-9ad84d392456">
  <data key="d3">The ability to convert the policy, as stated in fact_sentence_1, is restricted by the deadline defined in fact_sentence_2, which caps conversion eligibility at age 70 or policy termination, whichever comes first.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f02ad15a-f220-4368-928b-f055e35cac36" target="c98a305d-6028-47a0-875f-d569080ab9a3">
  <data key="d3">The ability to convert the policy provides future options for permanent coverage, which complements the insurer's non-contest clause that protects beneficiaries after two years of sustained coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="f02ad15a-f220-4368-928b-f055e35cac36" target="900f0b4d-30af-4caf-993b-7b70536f6667">
  <data key="d3">The ability to convert the policy provides long-term flexibility, enhanced here by the waiving of the aviation exclusion for private pilots, making conversion more valuable for those with such activities.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
<edge source="37d0e7ee-321f-4436-8b81-d04fe2104cde" target="f02ad15a-f220-4368-928b-f055e35cac36">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">provides conversion rights</data>
</edge>
<edge source="99c04a94-9701-4fa7-8add-91c1a08b0734" target="f02ad15a-f220-4368-928b-f055e35cac36">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">conversion eligibility under guarantee</data>
</edge>
