<edge source="43b0823e-cecd-4a91-a2c4-3d2108893b2c" target="fce22f63-5d59-4227-ac5b-655f0633c455">
  <data key="d3">From chunk 2’s perspective, chunk 1 establishes essential elements like beneficiary distribution, death benefit triggers, and critical rider functions that underpin the broader framework described later.</data>
  <data key="d4">provides foundation</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk_chunk</data>
  <data key="d6">True</data>
</edge>
<edge source="43b0823e-cecd-4a91-a2c4-3d2108893b2c" target="5b321824-be27-4378-b7be-2918947825be">
  <data key="d3">From chunk 2’s perspective, chunk 1 establishes essential baseline information—including the insured’s identity, coverage amount, beneficiaries, and underwriting status—that contextualizes why specific provisions like the aviation exclusion waiver and rider adjustments matter within the broader framework of personal risk management.</data>
  <data key="d4">contextual relation</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk_chunk</data>
  <data key="d6">True</data>
</edge>
<edge source="43b0823e-cecd-4a91-a2c4-3d2108893b2c" target="3a50b7ae-fa72-4c8d-89d2-bec45990f9e7">
  <data key="d3">From chunk 2's perspective, chunk 1 defines the optional enhancements available under the policy, such as accelerated death benefits and child coverage, which expand the scope of protection beyond standard terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">contextual relation</data>
  <data key="d5">0.92</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk_chunk</data>
  <data key="d6">True</data>
</edge>
<edge source="43b0823e-cecd-4a91-a2c4-3d2108893b2c" target="aa4c86ba-df00-4375-aaf9-be6ed0e949f3">
  <data key="d3">Chunk 1 establishes core elements like the accidental death benefit, premium schedule, and rider availability, which chunk 2 extends by detailing conversion thresholds, claim protections, and updated exclusions tied to personal activities such as private flying.</data>
  <data key="d4">contextual relation</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk_chunk</data>
  <data key="d6">True</data>
</edge>
<edge source="43b0823e-cecd-4a91-a2c4-3d2108893b2c" target="d29e9dfd-1897-408a-a17c-e48663ab1d13">
  <data key="d3">Chunk 2 reinforces the legitimacy and enforceability of the clauses described in chunk 1, particularly regarding beneficiary changes and rider adjustments, by specifying that such actions require no advance notice and proper documentation.</data>
  <data key="d4">elaborates on</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk_chunk</data>
  <data key="d6">True</data>
</edge>
