</edge>
<edge source="b3e12914-fba7-442d-8f31-2161867e424e" target="492892f5-2e11-4f7b-bd90-38065705a7b6">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee of renewable coverage up to age 95 establishes the framework under which premium increases occur during each renewal cycle.</data>
  <data key="d4">precedes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b3e12914-fba7-442d-8f31-2161867e424e" target="ac3feceb-a7e7-49d3-b0d9-b4f248709b5e">
  <data key="d3">Guaranteed renewability ensures long-term access to coverage, making it feasible for policyholders to exercise conversion rights later in life without needing new medical evaluations.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b3e12914-fba7-442d-8f31-2161867e424e" target="6f9d5bb4-e0cd-4a27-94a4-c6105a8fa692">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee of renewable coverage until age 95 ensures that the policyholder has sufficient time to exercise the option to convert coverage into permanent insurance before reaching age 70.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b3e12914-fba7-442d-8f31-2161867e424e" target="6fc66133-3b01-4f07-88d6-90152fe6617b">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee of renewable coverage until age 95 ensures the policy remains active long enough to allow conversion options before termination. This ongoing validity supports the possibility of converting coverage at any time prior to expiry.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b3e12914-fba7-442d-8f31-2161867e424e" target="c98a305d-6028-47a0-875f-d569080ab9a3">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee of renewable coverage until age 95 ensures sustained policyholder protection over time, enabling the enforcement of the insurer's inability to contest claims after two years of continuous coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b3e12914-fba7-442d-8f31-2161867e424e" target="0e09a261-66b0-4858-bea2-dde1aae36c41">
  <data key="d3">The guarantee of renewable coverage until age 95 ensures the policyholder maintains access to benefits over time, enabling future conversion options such as the required $50,000 minimum.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b3e12914-fba7-442d-8f31-2161867e424e" target="520ea8d4-9ede-4e65-88be-2ee9ab6039aa">
  <data key="d3">The guaranteed renewable nature of the policy ensures ongoing coverage up to age 95, while the limited incontestability exception reinforces trust in the policy's durability by restricting challenges to cases involving unpaid premiums.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b3e12914-fba7-442d-8f31-2161867e424e" target="a3c240d7-a2bf-45a9-8d80-9ad84d392456">
  <data key="d3">The policy’s guarantee of renewal until age 95 provides the overarching timeframe, under which the conversion option expires at the earlier of age 70 or policy termination.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditions</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b3e12914-fba7-442d-8f31-2161867e424e" target="fb8367db-a1ef-40f4-8f3b-2041da369dd7">
  <data key="d3">The policy's guaranteed renewability through age 95 provides the structural basis for enduring conditions like the aviation exclusion waiver, ensuring its continued applicability over time.</data>
  <data key="d4">contextual support</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b3e12914-fba7-442d-8f31-2161867e424e" target="d35ea843-3cf7-4434-abd8-5317e92704d1">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 confirms the guarantee of renewability until age 95, supporting and validating the detail provided in fact_sentence_1, thereby strengthening confidence in the long-term stability of the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">1.0</data>
</edge>
<edge source="b3e12914-fba7-442d-8f31-2161867e424e" target="f02ad15a-f220-4368-928b-f055e35cac36">
  <data key="d3">Guaranteed renewability ensures long-term access to the policy, enabling future exercise of the conversion privilege described in the first statement.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
