<edge source="6fc66133-3b01-4f07-88d6-90152fe6617b" target="b3e12914-fba7-442d-8f31-2161867e424e">
  <data key="d3">The ability to convert coverage before policy expiry implies the need for sustained policy existence, which is ensured by the guarantee of renewal through age 95.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6fc66133-3b01-4f07-88d6-90152fe6617b" target="ac3feceb-a7e7-49d3-b0d9-b4f248709b5e">
  <data key="d3">The availability of conversion before policy expiry provides context for why the absence of an insurability requirement matters—it allows timely access to permanent coverage under favorable terms.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6fc66133-3b01-4f07-88d6-90152fe6617b" target="6f9d5bb4-e0cd-4a27-94a4-c6105a8fa692">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 establishes a broad timeframe for conversion—before policy expiry—but Fact_sentence_2 introduces a more restrictive condition: conversion must occur before age 70, effectively narrowing the available period within the broader window.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6fc66133-3b01-4f07-88d6-90152fe6617b" target="a3c240d7-a2bf-45a9-8d80-9ad84d392456">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 indicates conversion eligibility before policy expiry, but fact_sentence_2 sets a hard deadline based on the earlier of policy end or age 70, limiting when such conversion can actually occur.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditions</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6fc66133-3b01-4f07-88d6-90152fe6617b" target="0e09a261-66b0-4858-bea2-dde1aae36c41">
  <data key="d3">Conversion eligibility before policy expiry allows policyholders to exercise the option to convert coverage, but only if it meets the minimum requirement of $50,000. This ensures that partial conversions still maintain meaningful coverage levels.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditions</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="30b95c2f-9cae-4221-93a3-aac79f06736d" target="6fc66133-3b01-4f07-88d6-90152fe6617b">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">undergoes conversion</data>
</edge>
