<edge source="6f9d5bb4-e0cd-4a27-94a4-c6105a8fa692" target="b3e12914-fba7-442d-8f31-2161867e424e">
  <data key="d3">The ability to convert coverage before age 70 depends on the policy remaining renewable; thus, the guarantee of renewal until age 95 supports this early conversion right.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6f9d5bb4-e0cd-4a27-94a4-c6105a8fa692" target="ac3feceb-a7e7-49d3-b0d9-b4f248709b5e">
  <data key="d3">Converting before age 70 enables access to permanent coverage, made easier by the absence of an insurability requirement.</data>
  <data key="d4">condition</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6f9d5bb4-e0cd-4a27-94a4-c6105a8fa692" target="6fc66133-3b01-4f07-88d6-90152fe6617b">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 sets an upper age limit of 70 for conversion, which constrains the flexibility implied by Fact_sentence_1, which allows conversion up to policy expiry regardless of age.</data>
  <data key="d4">limits</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6f9d5bb4-e0cd-4a27-94a4-c6105a8fa692" target="0e09a261-66b0-4858-bea2-dde1aae36c41">
  <data key="d3">The ability to convert coverage before age 70 sets the time window during which the conversion option applies; however, any such conversion must meet a minimum threshold of $50,000 in coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditions</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6f9d5bb4-e0cd-4a27-94a4-c6105a8fa692" target="a3c240d7-a2bf-45a9-8d80-9ad84d392456">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_1 specifies a time limit for conversion based on age, but fact_sentence_2 expands on this by introducing an additional limiting factor—the policy’s expiration date—making it clear that the earliest of the two events governs the final deadline.</data>
  <data key="d4">modifies</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6f9d5bb4-e0cd-4a27-94a4-c6105a8fa692" target="d35ea843-3cf7-4434-abd8-5317e92704d1">
  <data key="d3">While the policy remains renewable until age 95, the ability to convert to permanent insurance is limited to before age 70, meaning the full renewability does not extend to unlimited conversion rights beyond that point.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="6f9d5bb4-e0cd-4a27-94a4-c6105a8fa692" target="f02ad15a-f220-4368-928b-f055e35cac36">
  <data key="d3">Fact_sentence_2 limits the window for conversion to under age 70, which constrains the applicability of fact_sentence_1's broader claim about convertible options.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
