  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">section</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0e09a261-66b0-4858-bea2-dde1aae36c41" target="b7b7fd7d-97d8-4180-94ee-079ad0142dab">
  <data key="d2">fact_entity</data>
  <data key="d4">section</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0e09a261-66b0-4858-bea2-dde1aae36c41" target="b3e12914-fba7-442d-8f31-2161867e424e">
  <data key="d3">The requirement of a $50,000 minimum conversion amount assumes an active, renewable policy; thus, it relies on the policy being guaranteed renewable through age 95.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0e09a261-66b0-4858-bea2-dde1aae36c41" target="ac3feceb-a7e7-49d3-b0d9-b4f248709b5e">
  <data key="d3">A mandatory minimum conversion amount of $50,000 ensures that conversions serve substantial needs, aligning with the provision allowing conversion without medical underwriting by limiting it to significant policy adjustments.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0e09a261-66b0-4858-bea2-dde1aae36c41" target="6fc66133-3b01-4f07-88d6-90152fe6617b">
  <data key="d3">The $50,000 minimum conversion limit applies specifically when converting coverage before the policy expires, ensuring that any conversion maintains sufficient benefit value even during early stages of the policy term.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0e09a261-66b0-4858-bea2-dde1aae36c41" target="6f9d5bb4-e0cd-4a27-94a4-c6105a8fa692">
  <data key="d3">A mandatory minimum conversion amount of $50,000 limits the scope of conversions even if the insured is eligible before age 70, ensuring only substantial portions may be converted.</data>
  <data key="d4">limits</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0e09a261-66b0-4858-bea2-dde1aae36c41" target="a3c240d7-a2bf-45a9-8d80-9ad84d392456">
  <data key="d3">A minimum of $50,000 must be converted if any portion is converted, regardless of whether the conversion occurs before age 70 or at policy expiry. This requirement applies uniformly across the allowed timeframe defined by the earliest of those events.</data>
  <data key="d4">limits quantity</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="0e09a261-66b0-4858-bea2-dde1aae36c41" target="59a0f1ea-2c5e-4e7f-b51c-fc1ba344210e">
  <data key="d3">The requirement to provide evidence of insurability when adding riders may impact a policyholder's ability to modify their coverage, potentially affecting decisions about conversions involving larger amounts like $50,000.</data>
  <data key="d4">conditional dependence</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="7972b9cc-9e99-44e1-a620-238bc8d373cc" target="0e09a261-66b0-4858-bea2-dde1aae36c41">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">has minimum conversion amount</data>
</edge>
<edge source="ab7cd518-7a49-4a60-bd49-3b10a3b6d049" target="0e09a261-66b0-4858-bea2-dde1aae36c41">
  <data key="d2">entity_fact</data>
  <data key="d4">has minimum conversion amount</data>
</edge>
