<edge source="520ea8d4-9ede-4e65-88be-2ee9ab6039aa" target="b3e12914-fba7-442d-8f31-2161867e424e">
  <data key="d3">The restriction on contesting claims after two years—except for unpaid premiums—is meaningful because it safeguards the policyholder’s rights during the period when the policy remains guaranteed renewable.</data>
  <data key="d4">enhances</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="520ea8d4-9ede-4e65-88be-2ee9ab6039aa" target="ac3feceb-a7e7-49d3-b0d9-b4f248709b5e">
  <data key="d3">The limitation on claiming contests after two years supports the ease of converting coverage by ensuring long-term stability, aligning with the lack of medical underwriting required for conversion.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="520ea8d4-9ede-4e65-88be-2ee9ab6039aa" target="c98a305d-6028-47a0-875f-d569080ab9a3">
  <data key="d3">Non-payment of premiums serves as the sole exception to the incontestability clause, which otherwise prevents the insurer from challenging claims after two years of active coverage.</data>
  <data key="d4">limits</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="520ea8d4-9ede-4e65-88be-2ee9ab6039aa" target="1c9f056b-0c28-4ea8-968e-bcad5bdf0380">
  <data key="d3">The incontestability clause limits insurer challenges to claims, excluding only unpaid premiums. This allows the aviation-related death benefit to stand unless premium issues arise.</data>
  <data key="d4">contextual support</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="520ea8d4-9ede-4e65-88be-2ee9ab6039aa" target="d2c5d0f2-fe5f-40d2-938f-ede16175763c">
  <data key="d3">The incontestability clause limits insurer challenges to claims after two years, excluding only unpaid premiums. This allows broad claim validity, supporting inclusive benefits like passenger flight coverage without additional scrutiny.</data>
  <data key="d4">corroborates</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="520ea8d4-9ede-4e65-88be-2ee9ab6039aa" target="d35ea843-3cf7-4434-abd8-5317e92704d1">
  <data key="d3">While the incontestability clause protects against false statement challenges after two years, it does not override the requirement for timely premium payments—a condition reinforced by the policy’s guaranteed renewability through age 95 contingent upon continued payment.</data>
  <data key="d4">depends on</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
