<edge source="900f0b4d-30af-4caf-993b-7b70536f6667" target="97b70e0b-cf53-4c84-adbf-8397da3e2be9">
  <data key="d3">The aviation exclusion was waived because the insured engages in private piloting, which qualifies under the policy terms for exemption from the standard restriction.</data>
  <data key="d4">caused by</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="900f0b4d-30af-4caf-993b-7b70536f6667" target="1c9f056b-0c28-4ea8-968e-bcad5bdf0380">
  <data key="d3">The waiver of the aviation exclusion removes the restriction on aircraft operations, thereby permitting death benefits when the insured dies while operating an aircraft.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="900f0b4d-30af-4caf-993b-7b70536f6667" target="d2c5d0f2-fe5f-40d2-938f-ede16175763c">
  <data key="d3">The waiver of the aviation exclusion allows coverage for deaths occurring during flight activities, including being a passenger in an aircraft, thereby expanding the scope of protection under the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="900f0b4d-30af-4caf-993b-7b70536f6667" target="fb8367db-a1ef-40f4-8f3b-2041da369dd7">
  <data key="d3">The waiver of the aviation exclusion results in an increased annual premium by $175 to account for the elevated risk associated with allowing private piloting under the policy.</data>
  <data key="d4">causes</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="900f0b4d-30af-4caf-993b-7b70536f6667" target="64e3cf9e-d690-4b5b-9c5c-e6aff60fe010">
  <data key="d3">The waiver of the standard aviation exclusion allows coverage for private flying, but death resulting from military combat operations remains explicitly excluded despite the waiver.</data>
  <data key="d4">exception to</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.85</data>
</edge>
<edge source="900f0b4d-30af-4caf-993b-7b70536f6667" target="d35ea843-3cf7-4434-abd8-5317e92704d1">
  <data key="d3">The waiver of the aviation exclusion reflects a tailored adjustment to the policy, consistent with its broader provision of guaranteed renewability through age 95.</data>
  <data key="d4">complements</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.65</data>
</edge>
<edge source="900f0b4d-30af-4caf-993b-7b70536f6667" target="f02ad15a-f220-4368-928b-f055e35cac36">
  <data key="d3">The aviation exclusion waiver enables safer participation in flight-related risks, supporting the practical application of converting the policy into permanent coverage without fear of claim denial based on pilot status.</data>
  <data key="d4">enhances</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.75</data>
</edge>
