<edge source="97b70e0b-cf53-4c84-adbf-8397da3e2be9" target="900f0b4d-30af-4caf-993b-7b70536f6667">
  <data key="d3">Because the insured holds a private pilot license, the insurer has granted an exception to the standard aviation exclusion.</data>
  <data key="d4">explains</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="97b70e0b-cf53-4c84-adbf-8397da3e2be9" target="1c9f056b-0c28-4ea8-968e-bcad5bdf0380">
  <data key="d3">The aviation exclusion waiver, granted due to the insured's private piloting status, allows death benefits to apply when the insured dies while operating an aircraft.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
<edge source="97b70e0b-cf53-4c84-adbf-8397da3e2be9" target="d2c5d0f2-fe5f-40d2-938f-ede16175763c">
  <data key="d3">The waiver of the aviation exclusion due to private piloting activity expands coverage to include being a passenger in aircraft, ensuring protection even when not operating the plane.</data>
  <data key="d4">enables</data>
  <data key="d2">fact_fact</data>
  <data key="d5">0.95</data>
</edge>
